&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organization helps hospitals, banks, schools and government agencies stay resilient against cyberattacks, malicious insiders and operational disruption, and you&#39;ll do it for one of the fastest-growing corners of the data estate: unstructured data on NAS. As the Sales Specialist for NAS Cloud Direct, you own the number for this product in your territory. You&#39;ll be the go-to expert in the field, with the tools, enablement and One Rubrik selling motion to take your career, and your earnings, as far as your results allow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside Core Account Executives, Sales Engineers, Sales Development, Channel Development and our partners, and you&#39;ll be the consolidated voice of the field and customer back to Product Management, Product Marketing and PnP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own bookings growth for NAS Cloud Direct across new and existing accounts, building and executing a territory plan that meets and exceeds quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive daily pipeline generation to land net new logos, opening doors with customers who need to protect massive volumes of unstructured data without adding more on-prem backup infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify, build and close strategic opportunities in mid-enterprise accounts, and expand within the existing Rubrik base alongside Core AEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present NAS Cloud Direct within complex data center and cloud design conversations, helping customers see how they get faster, simpler recovery from ransomware and other disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell with Core AEs, Sales Engineers, distributors, resellers and VARs to build repeatable partner-led momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and evangelize the product inside and outside Rubrik, training the field on positioning, objection handling and competitive differentiation so more teams can sell it with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market and customer feedback to Product Management and Product Marketing, shaping what we build next and how we take it to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what&#39;s working with fellow Product Line Specialists, so the whole team learns faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of field technology sales experience, ideally selling data protection, storage, cloud infrastructure or NAS-related solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent track record of landing net new logos and consistently overachieving quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and managing pipeline across many accounts and verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort positioning a technical product in complex data center and cloud environments, and building champions across technical and business buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with channel partners, distributors and resellers to co-sell and grow a territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A driven, goal-oriented &quot;get it done&quot; mindset and the self-direction to generate your own momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to unstructured data challenges and enterprise NAS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling complex, multi-stakeholder solutions into mid-enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in product-specialist or overlay sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the competitive landscape in data protection and cloud storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of MEDDPICC for sales qualification &amp;amp; COtM sales methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sezzle:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a mission to financially empower the next generation, Sezzle is revolutionizing the shopping experience beyond payments, blending cutting-edge tech with seamless, interest-free installment plans that make shopping smarter and more accessible. We’re not just transforming payments; we’re redefining how people discover, interact with, and purchase the things they love while driving real impact on merchant sales through increased conversions and higher order values. As we continue to shape the future of fintech and retail, we’re building an innovative, dynamic team passionate about creating more than just a transaction but a truly unique shopping journey. If you’re excited about pushing boundaries in tech and delivering a game-changing experience for consumers and merchants alike, come join us at Sezzle and help create the future of shopping!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this principal development role, with 12+ years of experience, the compensation range is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$12,500 - $20,800 USD based on location and experience level &lt;/strong&gt;per month and in gross amount. This range acknowledges the extensive expertise, leadership capabilities, and significant contributions expected at this level, offering a competitive salary to reflect the value of advanced skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are seeking an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Principal Infrastructure Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, operate, and scale the platform that powers Sezzle. Your focus will be the hardest infrastructure problems: increasing throughput, reducing latency, removing capacity bottlenecks, strengthening resilience, and making production operations more automated and predictable as the business grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will own complex technical initiatives from architecture and prototyping through implementation, production rollout, and ongoing operation. Your impact will come from the systems you build, the problems you solve, and measurable improvements in reliability, performance, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our stack runs on &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, with workloads orchestrated on &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; and data anchored in &lt;strong&gt;Aurora RDS (MySQL and Postgres)&lt;/strong&gt;. You should know these technologies deeply and be comfortable moving between cloud architecture, networking, cluster internals, database performance, and application behavior to understand how the entire system scales. You will write code and infrastructure-as-code, debug production systems, and deliver changes that hold up under real traffic and failure conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Operational ownership is part of the job. You will &lt;strong&gt;participate in the on-call rotation&lt;/strong&gt; and take a hands-on role in recovering from major incidents, including full outages. We need someone who can form and test hypotheses using logs, metrics, and traces, make sound mitigation decisions with incomplete information, and turn incident findings into lasting engineering fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will also build and apply &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted infrastructure and SRE tooling&lt;/strong&gt; for incident investigation, capacity analysis, runbook automation, and toil reduction. You will evaluate these tools through practical results and apply appropriate access controls, validation, and auditability to their use in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This role reports to engineering leadership and works closely with application engineers, Security, and Compliance. You will develop a deep understanding of how Sezzle&#39;s business operates and how customer journeys, transaction patterns, and product decisions shape infrastructure demand and behavior. You will use that understanding to identify and deliver improvements across teams and technical domains, connecting infrastructure decisions to better customer outcomes and business performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the technical architecture and evolution of core infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: identify system limits, prioritize technical improvements, and implement changes that support increasing traffic, data volume, and workload complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect business understanding to improvements across the system&lt;/strong&gt;: learn how key business workflows behave in production, trace their impact across applications, data, and infrastructure, and partner across teams to improve performance, reliability, and cost efficiency beyond any single service or team&#39;s scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer for scale and performance&lt;/strong&gt;: build capacity models, run load and stress tests, diagnose bottlenecks across compute, networking, Kubernetes, and databases, and validate improvements against throughput, latency, saturation, and cost per workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and build AWS infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: implement resilient account, IAM, network, and service architectures; address service quotas, fault isolation, and multi-AZ or multi-region requirements as workloads grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and operate the Kubernetes platform&lt;/strong&gt;: improve cluster architecture, lifecycle automation, workload isolation, resource allocation, autoscaling, safe upgrades, and deployment reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and optimize Aurora RDS for MySQL and Postgres&lt;/strong&gt;: tune queries and indexes, address connection and replication bottlenecks, plan capacity, improve failover behavior, and implement safe schema changes and database migrations with application engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve reliability through engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: define and instrument service-level objectives and error budgets with service owners; implement failure isolation, backpressure, load shedding, and safe retry behavior where needed to prevent cascading failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in on-call and drive technical recovery during serious incidents&lt;/strong&gt;: use evidence-based triage, execute mitigations, communicate findings, and implement corrective actions from postmortems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement and test disaster recovery&lt;/strong&gt;: design backup, restore, and failover mechanisms against agreed recovery time and recovery point objectives; run recovery exercises and document measured results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build infrastructure-as-code and operational automation&lt;/strong&gt;: make provisioning, configuration, deployments, upgrades, and recovery reproducible, reviewed, testable, and recoverable. Eliminate recurring manual work through code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build observability that makes production diagnosable&lt;/strong&gt;: improve metrics, logs, traces, dashboards, and actionable alerts, with visibility into service health, scaling limits, and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver safe infrastructure migrations&lt;/strong&gt;: design phased rollouts, compatibility checks, validation, and rollback paths for changes to shared production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve cloud cost efficiency through technical changes&lt;/strong&gt;: right-size resources, improve utilization, tune autoscaling and storage, and quantify savings while maintaining reliability and performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and evaluate AI-assisted operational tooling&lt;/strong&gt;: apply AI to investigation, runbooks, anomaly analysis, and repetitive operations, with bounded permissions, reviewable actions, and measurable improvements in accuracy or toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make technical decisions clear and executable&lt;/strong&gt;: write architecture proposals, evaluate technology tradeoffs through prototypes and benchmarks, review changes affecting shared infrastructure, and document how systems operate and fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science or a similar technical field (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience across infrastructure, platform, site reliability, software development, or related engineering disciplines, with substantial hands-on depth designing and operating production infrastructure at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise with AWS&lt;/strong&gt;: production experience across compute, IAM, multi-account architectures, and networking, including VPC design and private connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise with Kubernetes in production&lt;/strong&gt;: cluster lifecycle, scheduling, resource management, autoscaling, networking, and troubleshooting business-critical workloads. EKS experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise with relational databases at scale&lt;/strong&gt;, specifically &lt;strong&gt;RDS/Aurora (MySQL and/or Postgres)&lt;/strong&gt;: query performance, indexing, connection management, replication, high availability, failover, and verified backup and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of personally delivering infrastructure scaling improvements&lt;/strong&gt;: identifying constraints, measuring baseline behavior, implementing changes, and demonstrating gains in capacity, latency, reliability, or cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong coding and automation skills&lt;/strong&gt;, using Golang, Python, or similar languages to build production tooling and eliminate operational toil, alongside infrastructure-as-code experience with Terraform or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong systems fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt;: Linux, networking, DNS, TLS, storage, concurrency, and distributed system failure modes, with the ability to debug problems across infrastructure and application boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience operating a &lt;strong&gt;24/7, high-availability platform&lt;/strong&gt; where downtime has direct customer or revenue impact, including hands-on incident response and postmortem remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/strong&gt; and demonstrated ability to recover production systems under pressure using evidence-based triage, safe mitigation, and clear technical communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience implementing and testing &lt;strong&gt;disaster recovery&lt;/strong&gt; against defined recovery objectives, including restoring data and validating service recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Practical experience with &lt;strong&gt;observability, load testing, capacity planning, and safe CI/CD practices&lt;/strong&gt; for shared production infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active use of AI tooling in engineering or operations&lt;/strong&gt;, with practical judgment about its limitations and how to verify generated code, recommendations, and operational actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ability to carry ambiguous technical problems from investigation through production delivery and collaborate across engineering disciplines to resolve system-wide constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Knowledge and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;fintech, payments, or banking&lt;/strong&gt;, operating infrastructure with demanding reliability, security, and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;multi-region architectures, chaos engineering, and failure testing&lt;/strong&gt;, including the consistency and recovery tradeoffs of distributed data systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Tempo&lt;/strong&gt;, or comparable observability systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;internal platform capabilities and self-service tooling&lt;/strong&gt;, including deployment automation, progressive delivery, and reusable infrastructure components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted incident investigation or operational automation&lt;/strong&gt; with restricted access, auditable execution, and clear human review points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have relentlessly high standards&lt;/strong&gt; - many people may think your standards are unreasonably high. You are continually raising the bar and driving those around you to deliver great results. You make sure that defects do not get sent down the line and that problems are fixed so they stay fixed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re not bound by convention&lt;/strong&gt; - your success—and much of the fun—lies in developing new ways to do things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You need action&lt;/strong&gt; - speed matters in business. Many decisions and actions are reversible and do not need extensive study. We value calculated risk-taking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You earn trust&lt;/strong&gt; - you listen attentively, speak candidly, and treat others respectfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have backbone; disagree, then commit &lt;/strong&gt;- you can respectfully challenge decisions when you disagree, even when doing so is uncomfortable or exhausting. You have conviction and are tenacious. You do not compromise for the sake of social cohesion. Once a decision is determined, you commit wholly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You deliver results &lt;/strong&gt;- you focus on the key inputs and deliver them with the right quality and in a timely fashion. Despite setbacks, you rise to the occasion and never settle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You go deep&lt;/strong&gt;: you investigate how systems behave under load and failure, follow the evidence, and fix underlying causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build and ship&lt;/strong&gt;: you turn architecture into working code, tested infrastructure, and safe production changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You measure results&lt;/strong&gt;: you can explain the impact of your work in availability, latency, capacity, recovery time, cost, or hours of toil removed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You value simplicity&lt;/strong&gt;: you choose systems that are understandable, operable, and appropriate to the problem, and reduce unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You earn trust&lt;/strong&gt;: you listen carefully, communicate clearly, challenge technical decisions respectfully, and follow through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You stay accountable for the outcome&lt;/strong&gt;: you verify that changes work in production and that fixes remain effective as the platform scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sezzle’s Technology Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Golang, Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database:&lt;/strong&gt; MySQL, Postgres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps and Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; AWS, Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD:&lt;/strong&gt; Gitlab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source:&lt;/strong&gt; Sezzle is focused on using open source, and we build what we can before buying!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Working at Sezzle Awesome?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sezzle, we are more than just brilliant engineers, passionate data enthusiasts, out-of-the-box thinkers, and determined innovators; we are skilled musicians, yogis, cyclists, chefs, golfers, dog-lovers, and rock-climbers. We believe in surrounding ourselves with not only the best and the brightest individuals, but those that are unique and purpose-driven in all that they do. Our culture is not defined by a certain set of perks designed to give the illusion of the traditional startup culture, but rather, it is the visible example living in every employee that we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Li-remote #full-time&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;c72cb78accbb&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Lead Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;9203abde8e4c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Reports to: Software Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;00cf1dcafad5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Department: Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;3eb2b3cabd8f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;fac87f3088b1&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;d2fcf4f24bf0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PQShield is looking for a Lead Software Engineer to help lead a cryptographic software IP team. As a Lead Software Engineer, you will be responsible for overseeing the entire software development lifecycle, from design to testing, and ensuring the delivery of high-quality software solutions. This includes planning, organizing, and managing the software development, including setting timelines, allocating resources, and tracking progress. You will work across a variety of environments, solving complex problems and developing other engineers, while maintaining a strong focus on quality and best practices. You will support the hiring, training, and managing of a team of software engineers, fostering collaboration, and resolving conflicts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;2f02d251f599&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ddad4c96-18bd-4352-be80-d6bb3e55ea2e&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;ddad4c96-18bd-4352-be80-d6bb3e55ea2e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;Candidates should hold a degree in Electronic Engineering/Computer Science or equivalent experience, backed by at least 10 years in software design and/or verification. We are looking for a technical lead—or a senior engineer ready to step up into leadership—to guide our team. Knowledge of cryptographic engineering and side-channel attack resistance is a major bonus. You should be ready to contribute to cross-team strategy, lead architectural reviews, and drive planning for your team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e1253695958c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;20e0d5a7-c8b2-476c-8a72-8438da12e0ce&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;20e0d5a7-c8b2-476c-8a72-8438da12e0ce&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;Founded in 2018, we are a well-funded deep tech startup with proven technology and a clear path to market. Joining us now offers a unique opportunity to work directly with our founders and inventors, fast-track your career progression, and shape a rapidly expanding segment of the semiconductor industry (Post-Quantum Cryptography and RISC-V).&lt;/span&gt; This is a great opportunity&amp;nbsp; for career progression and to get a head start in a rapidly expanding segment of the semiconductor industry (Post-Quantum Cryptography and RISC-V).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;df4c222c6338&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;24490093d3f7&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;4051e37fd161&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Working with other &lt;span id=&quot;43aa3e8e-802b-4816-a127-8abfa7ee5606&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;43aa3e8e-802b-4816-a127-8abfa7ee5606&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;engineering leaders&lt;/span&gt; and project managers to plan and allocate work, ensuring we are delivering on our product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You’ll be expected to take on a technical leadership role, and be responsible for coordinating and delivering application and embedded software IP design projects from conception to customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Line Management of a software engineering team:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Identifying hiring needs, conducting interviews, and selecting suitable candidates for open positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Orienting new colleagues, providing necessary training, and ensuring they have the tools and knowledge to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Setting clear expectations, providing regular feedback, conducting performance reviews, and recognising and rewarding achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Identifying training and development opportunities to help colleagues grow their skills and advance their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Addressing under-performance, providing coaching and support, and taking disciplinary action when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fostering positive relationships with team members, resolving conflicts, and promoting a positive work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring the software engineering team has all of the tooling and infrastructure it needs to function well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentoring other colleagues, and being a point of contact for software design expertise within the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Working with verification engineers to review verification and test plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Define architectural definitions for complex algorithmic and/or system level solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Providing feedback to colleagues on feasibility of implementation and specification quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Working closely with other teams and project stakeholders, and acting as an enabler for their development work. E.g. coordinating with hardware engineers or our product vulnerability team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Engaging with customers, including helping with integration questions, or answering questions during technical sales calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ensuring clean lint and implementation reports for IP blocks and subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;b0fdf9945c0c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;4b42e7e35ac1&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Confidence in planning out a project development cycle and coordinating with project managers as development progresses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;a443c1066507&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A commitment to high quality engineering in all areas of their work, including advocating for the best long-term solutions over the easiest or quickest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;72dd13eb0629&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Self-starter with the ability to work with and inspire a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;e7fe5099f3a8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience building software IP blocks from scratch, and owning the process from initial specification through to customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;86fcee610c73&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Expert level C experience in an embedded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;1f7f26b13b4c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Able to apply knowledge effectively in unfamiliar situations and actively maintains own knowledge and shares with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;533b7ec4b5b4&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Rapidly absorbs and critically assesses new information and applies it effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;2276e74b92f0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Specifies architectural solutions to technical challenges across multiple technical domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;7be1fb0bf4f6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Understanding of cryptographic algorithms, protocols, and key management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;👍 Preferred Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;53b8a646ba1c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Familiarity with PQC standards and protocols (e.g., NIST PQC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;b2e0b0848303&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Rust in an Embedded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;c77e2f9b6de8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Previous experience with software/hardware co-designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;0a7f6aaa4622&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Arm &amp;amp; RISC-V experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;1626397dcecd&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Knowledge of side-channel security countermeasures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;497cec53f378&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Confidence using Gitlab CI, or otherwise principles of continuous integration and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;5be13d0a36e6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Confidence with the Python programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;cc36332b58c5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Previous experience managing a cross-functional software team successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;🏆 Some of the perks of working with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;3f93816393a9&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Unparalleled opportunities to learn and accelerated career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;b684e8a99d1a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A collaborative, team environment with people who truly love what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;4bfa362572e8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and share option scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;f0688f19a07b&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flexible and hybrid working, and a working from home budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;9d65f512f2ff&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Private health insurance for yourself and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;1f32fc13e680&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;25 days annual leave (plus bank holidays and two wellness weeks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;19e78e1ab17d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;50% gym membership discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;6d14d961a72f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The chance to work with a spirited, smart, and friendly team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil international spécialisé en Data et Intelligence Artificielle, présent dans plus de 20 pays avec plus de 2 500 collaborateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leur transformation en combinant expertise technologique, conseil et connaissance métier, sur des enjeux allant de la stratégie Data &amp;amp; IA à la conception et au déploiement de solutions concrètes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos équipes réunissent notamment des Business Consultants, Data Analysts, Data Scientists et Data Engineers, qui interviennent auprès de grands groupes internationaux dans des secteurs variés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition : mettre la Data et l’IA au service de problématiques business concrètes et créer un impact mesurable pour nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton rôle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Talent Acquisition France et sous la responsabilité de la Head of Talent Acquisition, tu pilotes en autonomie le recrutement des équipes Strat Data d’Artefact, sur des profils allant de Junior à Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire des équipes opérationnelles, tu les accompagnes tout au long du processus afin de garantir des recrutements de qualité et une expérience candidat exigeante :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter les recrutements de bout en bout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recueillir et challenger les besoins auprès des managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et mettre en œuvre l’approche de recrutement adaptée à chaque besoin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter l’ensemble du processus : sourcing, qualification, entretiens RH, coordination des étapes d’évaluation et offre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer une approche proactive du sourcing et constituer des viviers de profils pertinents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accompagner les équipes opérationnelles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseiller et challenger les managers tout au long du processus afin de garantir des décisions de recrutement objectives et cohérentes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir la bonne application du processus et des méthodes d’évaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à une expérience de recrutement de qualité pour les candidatures et les équipes internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer à l’amélioration continue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de friction et contribuer à l’amélioration des processus et pratiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à la qualité et à la fiabilité des données dans notre ATS (Greenhouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer aux projets et initiatives de l’équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience confirmée en recrutement, idéalement dans le conseil/ ESN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise du recrutement de bout en bout, avec une solide pratique du sourcing et de l’approche directe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité à gérer et prioriser un périmètre de recrutement en autonomie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une posture de business partner, avec la capacité de conseiller et challenger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une bonne maîtrise des outils de recrutement et un bon niveau d’anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;jusqu’à 44K annuel selon profil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations continues et participation à des projets stratégiques d&#39;acquisition et de fidélisation des talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Équipe dynamique, flexibilité télétravail, séminaires d&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localisation Paris 9ème&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étapes du recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Mélody, Head of Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Laurie, DRH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce que vous construisez ne reste pas à l’état de démonstration : de vrais utilisateurs, au sein de grands groupes, s’en servent chaque jour. Applications et agents se conçoivent et s’exploitent en binôme avec l’AI Product Manager. Une équipe sinistres retrouve ainsi sur un seul écran les documents utiles et un brouillon de réponse ; ailleurs, un processus de commande ne demande plus aucune ressaisie manuelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce poste est fait pour vous si vous voulez que de vrais utilisateurs s’appuient sur ce que vous livrez.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact accompagne les plus grandes entreprises du monde dans le déploiement de l’IA : 3 000 AI makers dans plus de 30 pays, plus de 1 000 clients. En France, le département Engineering réunit environ 300 personnes sous la responsabilité du CTO ; vous y rejoignez le chapter AI Applied Engineer, archétype Product Engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activités et responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À chaque projet, l’AI Product Manager pilote le produit avec le client : ce qui se construit en premier, et la vérification que les utilisateurs s’en servent, se décident à deux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Autour de l’application, trois métiers se croisent : les AI Engineers pour le comportement du modèle, les Platform Engineers pour le déploiement, les Context &amp;amp; Analytics Engineers pour les données dont l’application a besoin. Les tests se font avec les utilisateurs finaux, le code se relit entre pairs et les nouvelles recrues sont accompagnées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Construire des applications métier : front end, back end et API.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des agents et des assistants dans un processus métier, avec des contrôles humains là où ils comptent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automatiser des processus de bout en bout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer un modèle dans un outil que les équipes utilisent déjà.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Construire les connecteurs dont le cas d’usage a besoin, par exemple un serveur MCP pour un outil métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concevoir l’expérience utilisateur de l’IA : quand une personne valide, comment afficher les sources et l’incertitude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Définir avec l’AI Product Manager les évaluations propres au cas d’usage et les suivre en production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assumer ce que vous livrez après la mise en production : monitoring, incidents, adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les indispensables :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous avez construit des applications avec un front end, un back end et des API, même si votre expertise est plus marquée d’un côté.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du code testé, relu et documenté, en Python, TypeScript ou dans un langage similaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les coding agents font déjà partie de votre quotidien, et vous vérifiez ce qu’ils produisent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Des besoins d’utilisateurs transformés en une première version, puis améliorée à partir de leurs retours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le monitoring, les incidents et l’adoption font, pour vous, partie du métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une aisance à expliquer vos choix techniques à des personnes non techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un plus, pas un prérequis :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de construction d’agents ou d’assistants au-dessus d’un LLM : appel d’outils, orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de conception de parcours avec validation humaine (human-in-the-loop) ou d’interfaces d’IA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience d’intégration à des logiciels métier, comme un ERP ou un CRM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience au contact des clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pas besoin de cocher toutes les cases pour postuler&lt;/strong&gt; : si vous avez l’essentiel des indispensables et l’envie d’apprendre le reste, parlons-en.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entre le produit, l’interface et le modèle, le Product Engineer occupe le point où l’IA rencontre ses utilisateurs. Leurs réactions s’observent directement, et chaque version livrée tient compte de ce que les usages ont révélé.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes des AI makers : l’IA se construit avec nos clients, pas seulement pour eux. Leurs enjeux deviennent les nôtres, et nos choix techniques s’expliquent dans le langage du métier. Les positions que nous prenons sont claires ; elles évoluent face aux faits, jamais sous la pression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre domaine change tous les mois, et ce rythme nous convient : les nouvelles technologies et les nouveaux secteurs s’apprennent vite, et les habitudes qui ne servent plus s’abandonnent sans regret. Devant un problème difficile, le réflexe est de le découper en étapes vérifiables, avec un haut niveau d’exigence sur le code comme sur les livrables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quand il manque quelque chose, pour un client ou pour le chapter, nous le construisons. La progression passe par des retours constructifs, par le partage des connaissances, par la demande d’aide sans attendre et par la reconnaissance du travail des autres. Il y a beaucoup à apprendre, et beaucoup à construire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un counsellor accompagne vos premiers mois. L’onboarding technique ouvre le parcours, suivi d’un premier projet client ; si aucun n’est prêt, les starter kits internes prennent le relais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le reste s’apprend sur les projets : conception d’agents, évaluation par cas d’usage, expérience utilisateur de l’IA, avec l’appui des AI Engineers et de la communauté Product Engineer. À partir de 2027, l’archétype Product Engineer disposera de sa propre grille de compétences et de son propre parcours de formation, en plus du socle commun à tous les AI Applied Engineers (évaluation de l’IA, responsabilité en production).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plus tard, un rôle transverse devient possible (Project Tech Lead, Pre-sales Engineer, Engineering Manager), tout comme le chapter AI Product Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le processus demande environ quatre heures, réparties en six étapes dont une seule sur site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien RH&lt;/strong&gt; (45 min, à distance) : parcours, motivations et points pratiques, comme le calendrier et les prétentions salariales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appel avec le CTO&lt;/strong&gt; (15 à 30 min, à distance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Screening technique&lt;/strong&gt; (30 min, à distance, avec un membre du chapter AI Applied Engineer) : retour détaillé sur vos projets passés, puis questions techniques et de design de solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code review et live coding&lt;/strong&gt; (60 min, sur site, avec un membre du chapter) : relecture d’un dépôt de code existant et correction de ses défauts, puis construction d’une nouvelle fonctionnalité avec un coding agent et présentation du résultat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cas technique&lt;/strong&gt; (45 min, à distance, avec un membre du chapter) : cadrage d’un problème métier, proposition d’une solution technique, description de la méthode d’évaluation, puis discussion de vos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien final&lt;/strong&gt; (30 min, à distance, avec une personne de l’encadrement du département, Engineering Manager ou Director) : reprise des points restés ouverts, choix de l’archétype et du niveau les mieux adaptés à votre profil, et réponses à toutes vos questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Selon les étapes, tous les outils d’IA sont autorisés, ou aucun. Lors du live coding, c’est la manière de travailler avec l’assistance de l’IA qui est observée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération &lt;/strong&gt;: 60 000€ à 70 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + jusqu’à 6 000€ de variable selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l’adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

