&lt;li&gt;Articulate the value of GitLab to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/sales/&quot;&gt;Mid Market&lt;/a&gt; prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of and act as the CEO for the book of business in your territory:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document the buying criteria &amp;amp; process, next steps &amp;amp; owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong pipeline through a healthy cadence of prospecting activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and close new business to expand your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adoption of our solutions and do your best to avoid churn and contraction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and collaborate with our Partner ecosystem to drive new business and value for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an accurate forecast for each quarter against your plan/budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive attendance to our events, which you will be part of to further network with current and prospective customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to root cause analyses on wins/losses.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate lessons learned to the team, including account managers, the marketing team, and the technical team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting improvements in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/sales/&quot;&gt;sales handbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, such as Customer Success, Renewals, Sales Development, etc. to provide account leadership, ensuring a good outcome for our customers in the pre- and post-sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the customer by contributing product ideas to our public &lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-ee/issues&quot;&gt;issue tracker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master MEDPICC and Command of the Message on all opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;requirements&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true desire to see customers benefit from the investment they make with GitLab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience with Software sales through pitching on value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in GitLab, and open source software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage established relationships and proven sales techniques for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator, strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, driven and results oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation, presentation and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience with Git, Software Development Tools, Application Lifecycle Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel regularly to meet with customers in person and comply with the company’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/finance/travel/&quot;&gt;travel policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is based on-site/hybrid in &lt;strong&gt;Copenhagen&lt;/strong&gt;, Denmark. We welcome applicants open to relocate and eligible to work in Denmark.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Retail sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their [Core Functional Area] ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Retail trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-NS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on, creative Content Creator Working Student to help tell our story. You’ll own our employer branding organic social content from start to finish brainstorming bold concepts, shooting, editing, and hitting the publish button. Working alongside recruiters, campaign managers, and designers, you’ll turn daily life behind the scenes into engaging content that stops top-talent scroll and gets them excited to join our ride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the End-to-End Creative Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch bold ideas, direct colleagues on camera, shoot mobile-first, and cut the final edit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn Raw Stories into High-Engagement Assets:&lt;/strong&gt; Capture real, behind-the-scenes moments and turn everyday footage into clips that our target persona actually wants to watch on LinkedIn and Instagram.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine Visual Craft &amp;amp; Brand Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; Sharpen your eye for pacing, color, and smart branding to make every piece of content look pro and cohesive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Currently enrolled student:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s in Media, Film, Communication, Design, or a related creative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong short-form editing chops:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Adobe Suite and CapCut, with a strong feel for hooks, retention editing, tempo, sound design, and color grading/color theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable behind the lens:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident shooting content on both a smartphone and a camera, with a solid eye for framing, lighting, and composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to build organized project files that can be easily adapted and reused across different social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (Dutch, French, or German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability&lt;/strong&gt;: Available for at least 16 hrs p/w (the more, the merrier!) for a minimum of 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus: Working knowledge of After Effects for animations/graphics, or photography skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t tick all the boxes yet? Picnic is the perfect learning environment for the highly ambitious and the deeply curious. If you align with Picnic’s mission, please feel free to send your application through.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it&#39;s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We&#39;re especially keen on keeping great talent around; perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore transitioning you into a full-time role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll receive a gross hourly wage of €16,75 (incl. holiday pay) along with a laptop to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4PS is part of the Hilti Group&lt;/strong&gt;, which gives our people access to international opportunities and development programs within the wider Hilti organization. This vacancy is part of Hilti’s Global Trainee Program. Interested in joining the program? Please submit your application directly via &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.hilti.group/de-ch/stellenangebote/19051-en/global-trainee-program-outperformer-software-business-track-m-f-x/&quot;&gt;Hilti Careerpage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Construction technology is being reinvented. Be part of it.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Construction is one of the world&#39;s largest industries, and one of its least digitized. That is changing fast. At Hilti, we are not only developing software products - we are building and growing digital businesses around them. Hilti is at the centre of that shift, with a growing portfolio of software products that connect jobsites, offices, teams, and tools across the entire construction lifecycle. We are looking for ambitious, internationally mobile early-career talents with a global mindset who are excited about technology but see their future in business and leadership rather than in a purely technical software career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Software &amp;amp; Digital Business Track of Hilti&#39;s Outperformer Program is a two-year accelerated development program that prepares you for a commercial, international leadership career in our software and digital businesses. You will learn how technology becomes customer value, how software businesses grow, how products are brought to market, and how commercial decisions are made. This is not a rotation program where you shadow senior leaders. From day one, you carry real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Software Track is designed to build the next generation of software business leaders at Hilti – Business Owners, Business Directors, Segment Managers and ultimately Senior Management Team members. If you want a structured path to running a business, this program is built for that outcome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The program places you inside one of two business units:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Construction Software: Home to Fieldwire (Field Software for project and workforce management), ON!Track (asset management), and 4PS (construction business management). You will work directly with customers, product teams, and business leadership across Europe and beyond.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fastening &amp;amp; Protection Solutions: Where design &amp;amp; engineering software for structural connections (e.g. PROFIS Engineering Suite), MEP supports and passive fire protection systems are developed and brought to market across a global customer base of structural and mechanical engineers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For the Construction Software business unit, the program is structured to provide a balanced foundation in customer and market exposure, software product understanding, and business experience, while giving you the opportunity to work with at least two software products during the program:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​Year 1: Begin with a 12-month sales assignment, developing direct customer insight and understanding the business challenges addressed by our software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​Year 2: Undertake three rotations of 3–6 months each across product and business teams, including exposure to an international project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​For the Fastening &amp;amp; Protection Solution business unit, the program provides exposure to product management , software development, exposure to customers and start-ups and international project experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​Year 1: Begin with a 12-month product management assignment, building product understanding and market insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​Year 2: Undertake three rotations of 3–6 months each, involving international projects that broaden your business perspective and global exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a dedicated senior mentor from the start, direct exposure to executive leadership, and a peer cohort of Global Trainees across all Hilti business tracks globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are close to graduating or have recently completed a Master&#39;s degree - your degree is likely to be in construction management, civil engineering, or mechanical engineering with a focus on construction, Computer Science, or also Business study programs with an affinity for Software and construction. What matters more than your degree subject is the combination of traits below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global mobility - you are willing and able to relocate internationally, multiple times. A global thinker who is keen for diverse cultural experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital and AI orientation - you think natively in digital workflows, comfortable with software tools, and know the power and potential of AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language - you are fluent in English and/or German, Dutch, French, Spanish or Italian. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct - you are drawn to how businesses grow, how customers make decisions, and how products create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, high drive - you take the work seriously and yourself lightly. You seek feedback, move fast, and are energised by ambiguity rather than unsettled by it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are at the start of your career and have maximum three years of junior work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s In It for You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​Show us what you can do, and in return, we promise you the experience of a lifetime. We offer you a transformative journey filled with learning, growth, and invaluable experiences that will shape your perspective and personal and professional development. On top of that, you’ll also take part in some fascinating courses and events:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory Global Summit: Experience 4 days at our global headquarters in Liechtenstein, featuring the presence of our Executive Board and Global Senior Leadership. The summit offers a comprehensive overview of our business, while fostering soft skill development and meaningful collaboration with fellow program participants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social Project Summit: 7 days dedicated to building a better future, with contribution to a hands-on, high-impact community project. This experience offers the chance to immerse yourself in a different culture while actively improving living conditions for those in need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership Summit: An enriching learning journey in partnership with a renowned business school, featuring online modules and collaborative projects with fellow program participants. The experience concludes with a 5-day on-campus summit to deepen insights and to foster business and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Hilti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hilti is a global leader in construction innovation, with more than 34,000 team members across 120 countries. Guided by our purpose, Making Construction Better, we’re driven to keep learning, growing, and finding new ways to make a lasting impact. Here, you’ll be empowered to use your strengths, work with a global and inclusive team, and take on meaningful challenges. At Hilti, you’ll have the chance to make your ideas, achievements, and growth real through purpose, passion, and teamwork.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learn more about our recruitment process: https://careers.hilti.group/en/candidate-interview-preparation/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Commitment to Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​At Hilti, inclusion is a key focus in how we work, lead, and grow together. We are committed to embracing diversity of thought and creating an environment that is inclusive of everyone, everywhere. We continuously strive to ensure every voice is valued and every team member feels empowered to contribute. By building on this foundation, we strengthen our teams, our innovation, and our impact, making construction better together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;​Exciting software journey: You will dive into the fast-paced world of our construction software business, gaining exposure to innovative digital solutions that are transforming one of the world&#39;s largest industries.&lt;br&gt;​&lt;br&gt;​Global cross-team collaboration: You will work with colleagues worldwide and get guidance from a dedicated mentor as you grow in your career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;​We hire for a career, not for a position. If you are looking for long-term career prospects and opportunities to grow, this is the perfect start.​&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;​Are you ready to jumpstart your career? Our hiring process is designed to help you showcase your skills and experience. The process has multiple steps and requires a longer period of time:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It all starts with your application and a video interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get connected with our HR team in an online interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get ready to flex your problem-solving muscles with our online Business Case Round.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impress our Business Line Managers with your presentation skills and insights during the next round.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And, if you make it to the end, you&#39;ll receive an invitation to our Assessment Center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​Exciting, right? Let&#39;s get started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4PS is part of the Hilti Group&lt;/strong&gt;, which gives our people access to international opportunities and development programs within the wider Hilti organization. This vacancy is part of Hilti’s Global Trainee Program. Interested in joining the program? Please submit your application directly via &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.hilti.group/de-ch/stellenangebote/19051-en/global-trainee-program-outperformer-software-business-track-m-f-x/&quot;&gt;Hilti Careerpage&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;​The Assessment Center will take place in Liechtenstein at Hilti Headquarter on December 1st and 2nd, 2026. Applications will be reviewed in the order they’re received, so we encourage you to apply as soon as possible since there are limited spots for the Assessment Center!​&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learn more about our recruitment process:&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.hilti.group/en/candidate-interview-preparation/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Candidate Interview Preparation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​For further questions, please feel free to contact Vanessa Furtner ----- and (My LinkedIn).&lt;br&gt;​&lt;br&gt;*For non-EU / EFTA citizens: Please state your eligibility status to work in EU or UK countries and note that if you do not own a valid work permit, Hilti cannot guarantee your final employment due to authority regulations.​&lt;/p&gt;
