&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe data Customer Relationship recherche un·e Data manager basé·e à Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre vision de la Pricing Excellence repose sur une approche globale de Revenue Growth Management (RGM) visant à établir le juste prix pour le consommateur et ainsi maximiser la valeur client et la rentabilité de l&#39;entreprise. Notre objectif est de délivrer une tarification data-driven qui équilibre le coût total, la perception client et la viabilité financière de l&#39;entreprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour cela, nous exploitons les outils digitaux, la Data et l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle afin de maximiser les revenus et d&#39;assurer une efficacité opérationnelle orientée vers le client. L&#39;équipe est structurée autour d&#39;un Centre d&#39;Excellence Pricing et d&#39;une équipe Data &amp;amp; AI, qui développent de concert des solutions novatrices et industrielles pour optimiser proactivement la tarification et l&#39;expérience client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION ET IMPACT STRATÉGIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, tu rejoins l&#39;équipe de direction Digital Customer Relationship au sein de laquelle tu seras garant de la définition des priorités DATA (gouvernance, Business Intelligence, modèle de données, référentiels, IA) pour l&#39;activité &lt;strong&gt;Pricing&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu définiras et porteras la vision stratégique Data &amp;amp; AI qui permet d’accompagner la transformation du Pricing et du RGM à l’échelle de l’entreprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Membre clé du leadership, tu pilotes une organisation d&#39;une dizaine d&#39;experts Data (Data Scientists, Data Engineers, Analytics Engineers) et tu garantis l’alignement parfait entre l&#39;innovation technologique, l&#39;excellence opérationnelle et les ambitions économiques globales du groupe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSABILITÉS CLÉS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision stratégique &amp;amp; feuille de route Data:&lt;/strong&gt; définir la trajectoire Data &amp;amp; AI pluriannuelle (gouvernance, IA générative &amp;amp; prédictive, architecture, BI, référentiels) alignée sur les enjeux stratégiques du Pricing et du RGM. Arbitrer et prioriser les investissements technologiques à haut ROI en étroite collaboration avec les Product Managers et les représentants métier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership, culture &amp;amp; développement des talents:&lt;/strong&gt; inspirer, structurer et faire évoluer une équipe à fort niveau d&#39;expertise. Instaurer un environnement d&#39;excellence, attirer les meilleurs talents, développer le leadership des collaborateurs et garantir un modèle d&#39;organisation agile, bienveillant et performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gouvernance, ROI &amp;amp; création de valeur Business:&lt;/strong&gt; incarner la culture de la valeur auprès des directions métiers (Revenue Management, Directeurs Commerciaux, Finance). Définir la grille d&#39;évaluation de la création de valeur apportée par les solutions IA et assurer une gouvernance rigoureuse des actifs Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellence opérationnelle:&lt;/strong&gt; garantir l&#39;excellence technique et le niveau d&#39;exigence industriel (robustesse, sécurité, éthique de l&#39;IA, monitoring, haute disponibilité). Insuffler la culture MLOps/DataOps pour accélérer le passage de l&#39;expérimentation à la production à grande échelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence transversale:&lt;/strong&gt; garantir un alignement fluide avec les Engineering Managers et les Product Managers, dans et en dehors du domaine digital. Inculquer une véritable culture de la Data au sein des équipes produits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion budgétaire &amp;amp; pilotage économique:&lt;/strong&gt; définir, piloter et gérer le budget global de l&#39;équipe et des infrastructures Data/IA associées. Assurer la planification financière annuelle et pluriannuelle (horizon 3 ans), en optimisant les coûts liés aux RUN (infrastructures cloud, coûts de calcul et licences) tout en maximisant la valeur produite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL RECHERCHÉ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience&lt;/strong&gt;: expérience confirmée dans la Data &amp;amp; l&#39;IA, dont au moins 4 à 5 ans sur des fonctions de management d&#39;équipes pluridisciplinaires ou au sein d&#39;une leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences stratégiques&lt;/strong&gt;: capacité démontrée à traduire des enjeux business complexes (Pricing, Retail, RGM) en stratégies Data &amp;amp; AI applicables et rentables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: posture de leader inspirant, capacité à négocier et à influencer, excellence managériale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Savoir-faire technique&lt;/strong&gt;: solide culture de l&#39;industrialisation IA (DataOps/MLOps), de la gouvernance des données et de l&#39;architecture moderne des plateformes Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Precision for Medicine, we are always looking to connect with exceptional talents, and we are currently seeking &lt;strong&gt;Senior Clinical Research Associates&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Poland, Hungary, United Kingdom, France and Germany&lt;/strong&gt; to support a dedicated &lt;strong&gt;FSP partnership&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with a strategic sponsor in a highly collaborative and quality-focused environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This evergreen posting is part of our ongoing talent pipeline strategy and enables interested candidates to be considered for future opportunities aligned with upcoming project requirements. While there may not be an immediate opening, candidates whose experience matches our anticipated needs will be considered for future opportunities as they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position can be offered fully home-based within France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are calm, thoughtful, and responsive when things don’t go as planned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are well-prepared, whether it be for an investigator meeting, site visit or project team update, always staying two steps ahead of the game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find quick and creative ways of overcoming difficulties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an impeccable eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify potential study risks and propose solutions on how to mitigate them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take responsibility in the quality and outcomes of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at handling conflict by using tried and true resolution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we will keep you busy and support your growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will monitor and own the progress of clinical studies at investigative sites and ensure that clinical studies are conducted, recorded, and reported per protocol, SOPs, ICH-GCP, and all applicable regulations and standards. You will coordinate all necessary activities required to set up and monitor a study (i.e., identify investigators; helping prepare regulatory submissions, conducting pre-study and initiation visits, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior CRAs handle appropriately sized clinical trials, and support clinical study teams with trials that are larger in scope. You will also have the opportunity to train and mentor junior staff members. You will interact directly with clients, initiate payments, and participate in proposal activities, including development and client presentations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Minimum Required&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-year college degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holder of CRA certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Other Required&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum 5 years of CRA/SCRA&lt;/strong&gt; experience within a CRO, pharmaceutical, biotechnology, or medical device environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience monitoring clinical trials across a variety of therapeutic areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability for domestic travel including overnight stays, which may constitute up to approximately 50-60% travel commitment (international travel may be required for some senior level positions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English and the local language&lt;/strong&gt; is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional language(s) will be considered an asset &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate or postgraduate degree with a concentration in a scientific or healthcare discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study start up activities experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Senior CRAs, understanding of financial management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Precision for Medicine?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Precision for Medicine, we combine the agility and collaboration of a specialized CRO with the scientific expertise needed to support innovative clinical development programmes. Our employees are empowered to make an impact, build meaningful client relationships, and grow their careers in an environment that values quality, accountability, and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This is an evergreen opportunity intended to build our network of experienced clinical research professionals for future project requirements. Hiring decisions and timelines will be dependent upon business needs and upcoming study opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please, apply in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EK1 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any data provided as a part of this application will be stored in accordance with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.precisionmedicinegrp.com%2Fprivacy-policy%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Czeta.larcon%40precisionmedicinegrp.com%7Cb58fe8b0c3ea4dd2e79d08db5bd09a25%7Cb71ff3f628164ca8a9b938f820f91ad1%7C0%7C0%7C638204723732367131%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=9DgboiHTFPrNYVhdKhyfdwVyNYwUvZbP%2FroLdWIIfxw%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;For CA applicants, please also refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.precisionmedicinegrp.com%2Fca-applicants-privacy-notice%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Czeta.larcon%40precisionmedicinegrp.com%7Cb58fe8b0c3ea4dd2e79d08db5bd09a25%7Cb71ff3f628164ca8a9b938f820f91ad1%7C0%7C0%7C638204723732367131%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=tfAqqMZsG%2B11IchL45HFFVbfECCkYqQpNr0PQxrMFJU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;CA Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision Medicine Group is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, veteran status or other characteristics protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are an individual with a disability and require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application process or are limited in the ability or unable to access or use this online application process and need an alternative method for applying, you may contact Precision Medicine Group at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Warning: &lt;/strong&gt;Please be aware that fraudulent individuals and websites may impersonate Precision Medicine Group or its affiliates and attempt to obtain personal, financial, or banking information through fake job postings or employment offers. Precision Medicine Group will never request payment, banking details, or other sensitive financial information as part of the recruitment process. If you believe you have been targeted by a recruitment scam, we encourage you to report the incident to your local law enforcement authorities, consumer protection agency, or relevant cybercrime reporting organization in your country. Please also notify us at &lt;a id=&quot;menur2oq&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; ----- ----- so we can investigate and take appropriate action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the country of employment without employer sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence, and guest-centered ethos that define Airbnb. This team’s mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping independent, boutique hotels easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you will be responsible for converting leads into net‑new supply to support new-market launches and at pace to hit quarterly goals. Working the full sales funnel, you will proactively turn cold leads into warm sales opportunities helping to build the Hotels category’s market presence in the process through collaboration with other teams. This includes partnering, strategizing, and running daily operations directly with independent, boutique hotels , and ensuring that Airbnb sources&amp;nbsp; the best hotel inventory available to our guests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Paris (hybrid, 2 days a week in the office).&amp;nbsp; It will start off as a 12-month FTC with the potential for conversion depending on individual performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed KPIs by owning the performance and success of assigned region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect new potential hotels through external research, networking, and use of Airbnb tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securing new hotels involves targeted sales strategies and negotiating and closing the deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops acquisition strategies and scalable, localised supply strategies for established and emerging markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertly position and communicate Airbnb’s value proposition to new partners via phone, email, and in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add net new hotels by qualifying and moving leads through the funnel as quickly as possible, achieving defined quarterly goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find supply in and launch new markets: Own market launches including supporting lead generation and coordinating cross functionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hotel onboarding as needed from won sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively promote and build strong relationships with hotels by demonstrating comprehensive knowledge of our platforms and confidently pitching their value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience, preferably in a fast growing startup tech or hospitality company working in sales and/or account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous hospitality experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in both English and French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM required; Proficiency in Salesforce, Gong and other scalable AI Sales prospecting tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to get things done with constantly changing priorities, projects and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, organizational, and analytical skills, detail-oriented but moves fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to establish strong relationships with and influence partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to balance day-to-day responsibilities with longer-term strategic execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a quick learner and you’re fearless about doing whatever it takes to get the job done, even if it means making mistakes along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel up to 25-30% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Airbnb and travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We’ll Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for variable incentive pay, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The On-Target Earnings (“OTE”) range for this role is €98,000 to €115,000 gross per year, which includes a split of 80% (base pay) / 20% (variable incentive).&amp;nbsp;Of this OTE amount, the annual gross base salary range is €78,400 to €92,000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The OTE reflected on this job posting is the target cash compensation a candidate could earn in a year if they achieve 100% of their performance or sales goals. The variable incentive is not guaranteed and is governed by the terms of Airbnb’s Hotels Variable Compensation Plan (the “Plan”). The actual payouts depend on performance against targets set under the “Plan” and may be higher or lower than the range listed on this job posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is looking for a Marketing &amp;amp; CRM intern to join the Experiences team in Paris for a 6-month internship.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the person in charge of Demand for Paris Experiences, alongside Marketing, Growth and Product Management partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experiences let guests step into the real life of a destination: cook with a local chef, explore a hidden neighborhood with a historian, discover Paris through the eyes of the people who live there. Paris is one of our most iconic and competitive markets, and our job on the Demand side is to make sure the right guests find the right Experience at the right moment, whether they are visiting Paris or live nearby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a curious, organized and data-friendly student who loves the craft of CRM and Operational Marketing: a sharp brief, a well-built email, a smart audience, and an analysis that tells us what to do next. You are comfortable juggling several campaigns at once, working with different teams, and turning numbers into clear recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support the Paris Experiences Demand lead on the day-to-day CRM and marketing activity that drives bookings. You will see a campaign from the first brief to the final analysis, and you will own your own projects along the way. During your internship, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Run email campaigns end to end&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write briefs for email campaigns (audience, objective, key messages, timing) and coordinate with copy, design and CRM partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute campaigns through our internal tools and planning process, including setup, QA and send follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze results after each send (opens, clicks, bookings, incrementality) and share clear learnings and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support listing promotion and audience targeting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cohorts of guests (new vs. returning, local vs. traveler, International vs Domestic) to understand behavior over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build simple, readable dashboards and recurring reports to select and prioritize listings based on quality, availability, performance and fit with the campaign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Market and Supply teams to make sure what we promote is bookable and best-in-class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn insights into concrete recommendations for audiences, timing and messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Follow local activations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational support and follow-up on field campaigns such as flyering, partnerships, events or more: briefing, logistics, timing, partners and results tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help measure what works locally and recommend future iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The intern experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will be part of a team where you contribute to real projects with real business impact. Your manager, your team and our wider employee community will strive to be superhosts to you during your internship. We provide the support, mentorship and hands-on experience you need to learn quickly and make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get a front-row seat on how a global marketplace builds demand for a destination, with real ownership from day one: your campaigns go live and your analyses shape decisions. You’ll do it alongside a team that cares about craft, curiosity and human connection. You can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Market Management and Acquisition partners to deliver projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present your analyses and recommendations to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek and give feedback throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the Experiences and broader Airbnb community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Current student or recent graduate&lt;/strong&gt; (degree completed within the last 12 months) from a leading business school, engineering school or equivalent program in France, looking for a 6-month internship starting in January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/strong&gt;, with excellent written communication: you can write a clear brief and a clear recap. You also have an eye for great copy and for what makes a message feel human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong interest in marketing, CRM or growth&lt;/strong&gt;, and in travel, hospitality or community-driven products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious about data and performance metrics&lt;/strong&gt;, with an interest in using insights and quantitative analysis to evaluate campaigns, track performance, and inform decision-making. Experience with Claude or other AI tools to work faster and smarter is a must-have.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, able to manage several campaigns and deadlines in parallel, and to follow up until everything is done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative mindset &lt;/strong&gt;and the confidence to work with people across teams, from Marketing to Product to Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have work authorization for France. Visa sponsorship is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to the nature of this position, the successful applicant will need to be based in Paris, France to be able to conduct their work. Interns can expect to spend half of their time at the office and half working remotely with exact dates as agreed upon by the hiring manager. Additional in-person attendance for team meetings or offsites may be required as needed. Please note we are unable to provide relocation or visa sponsorship for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion &amp;amp; belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL) works with governments and partners to strengthen and transform primary health care (PHC) to improve health and save lives. Our approach focuses on making PHC more prioritized, proactive and accountable for outcomes, and strengthening how care is organized, delivered, financed and measured. Drawing on expertise across RTSL&#39;s portfolio, we bring together solutions in health system resilience and epidemic readiness, digital health and data-driven decision-making, performance measurement and improvement, and sustainable health financing. We apply these capabilities to address priority health challenges, including cardiovascular health, maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, while strengthening health systems to deliver more equitable, effective and resilient care. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Position Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Maternal &amp;amp; Reproductive Health will provide strategic and technical leadership for RTSL&#39;s portfolio to reduce preventable maternal deaths and improve sexual and reproductive health outcomes. The role will lead the development and implementation of a multi-country program that strengthens government capabilities to identify and address barriers to quality care, translate data into action, and deliver measurable improvements in health outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director will have overall accountability for the strategy, resources, quality, performance, and results of the maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, leading a multidisciplinary team and working closely with governments, technical partners, and colleagues across RTSL to design, implement and scale evidence-informed approaches. The role requires deep expertise in sexual, reproductive and maternal health, strong program leadership, and the ability to translate technical evidence into practical, sustainable health system improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;100% Remote with travel as stated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employment for a fixed term of 24 months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Core Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and Portfolio Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction, priorities and implementation approach for RTSL&#39;s maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, exercising delegated authority to make program investment, resource allocation, and partnership decisions within approved organizational parameters and in alignment with country priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a multi-country portfolio, with accountability for program planning, budget development and management, resource allocation, performance and delivery against strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage a multidisciplinary team, establishing clear responsibilities and performance expectations, overseeing staffing and talent development, addressing performance and capacity gaps, and building the capabilities needed for sustained program delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Program Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert technical leadership across maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, including maternal death surveillance and response, quality maternal care, family planning, and adolescent pregnancy prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and adaptation of evidence-informed approaches that connect data-driven learning with targeted improvements in clinical care, service delivery and wider health system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the design and implementation of country programs, identifying opportunities to strengthen government leadership, institutional capabilities and sustainable approaches to improving health outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and collaboration across RTSL&#39;s technical teams, drawing on expertise in PHC delivery, digital health, measurement and financing to address priority health system bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Engagement and Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior-level engagement with Ministries of Health and national partners to identify priorities, shape country strategies and secure government ownership of programs and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage strategic partnerships with donors, multilateral agencies, technical institutions and implementing partners, identifying opportunities for collaboration, investment and program expansion, and representing RTSL in high-level technical and policy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Learning and Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain overall accountability for portfolio performance and results, establishing clear performance expectations and monitoring mechanisms, and using evidence and implementation learning to inform strategic decisions, address delivery challenges, and adapt approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the generation, synthesis and dissemination of evidence and practical learning to inform policy, program improvement and scale-up across countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in medicine, public health, sexual and reproductive health, obstetrics and gynecology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 15 years of relevant global health experience, including substantial technical and leadership experience in sexual, reproductive and maternal health in low- and middle-income countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and leading complex, multi-country programs, including strategic planning, budget oversight and accountability for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience engaging senior government officials, donors and international partners, with the ability to build relationships and influence strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized technical expertise in maternal survival and reproductive health, with a strong understanding of evidence-based interventions, health service delivery and health system strengthening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead and develop multidisciplinary teams and manage programs across different countries and organizational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data-driven program improvement, implementation challenges and approaches to translating evidence into sustainable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic thinking, judgement, communication and leadership skills, with the ability to navigate complex political and operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; proficiency in French desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally, approximately 30% during program start-up and up to 25% thereafter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for applicants based in the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is $150,000 to $170,000 annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate&#39;s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contributions toward retirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; 27 November 2026 (&lt;em&gt;This position may close earlier if a high volume of applications is received before the stated deadline&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;RTSL believes its programs are strengthened when they are developed and supported by individuals with diverse life experiences whose understanding of social and cultural issues can help make our work and workforce more inclusive. We encourage applications from and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, ancestry, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, marital status, organ donor status, or status as a veteran. Resolve to Save Lives &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;complies with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; all applicable US EEO laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm that transforms organizations through data and AI. With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. From our Lausanne and Zurich offices, we help leading Swiss and international companies turn data and AI into measurable results, working with the leading data platforms, including Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will design and deliver the data platforms our clients run their business and their AI on, combining hands-on engineering with client advisory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build modern data platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; End-to-end lakehouse architectures, mainly on Databricks, built for reliability, observability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Batch and streaming pipelines with Python, Spark, and SQL, with data quality built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrate and modernize:&lt;/strong&gt; Move legacy warehouses and ETL to the cloud, from assessment to cut-over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data ready for AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Governed data products and semantic layers that analytics and AI agents can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run it properly:&lt;/strong&gt; Data governance, CI/CD, infrastructure as code, monitoring, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise and support:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business needs into roadmaps, coach junior engineers, and support proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engineer first, consultant second, with a track record of shipping to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in data engineering, including hands-on Databricks experience in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Python and SQL, with strong Spark and data modeling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional certification, or a commitment to obtain it within 6 months (we support you).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on Azure, AWS, or GCP, plus DataOps (Git, CI/CD, Terraform, testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting skills: requirements gathering, documentation, stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English plus French or German (both is a plus); eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with other data platforms (Snowflake, Microsoft Fabric, BigQuery), dbt, MLOps, and industry experience (consumer goods, pharma, logistics, insurance, manufacturing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the platforms behind boardroom priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swiss Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one on flagship programs, working directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Tech Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Certified peers across Artefact and close partnerships with leading data and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Certifications, training, international missions, and a team of doers who move fast and support each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Tell us about your passion, curiosity, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe that privacy is a fundamental human right and the cornerstone of democracy. Since our inception in 2014, founded by a team of scientists from CERN, we have dedicated ourselves to providing free and open-source technology to millions worldwide, ensuring access to privacy, security, and freedom online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our journey began with Proton Mail, the largest secure email service globally, and has since expanded to include Proton VPN, Proton Calendar, Proton Drive, and Proton Pass. These tools empower individuals and organizations to take control of their personal data, break away from Big Tech’s invasive practices, and defeat censorship. Our work impacts hundreds of millions of lives, from activists on the front lines defending freedom to leaders in governments protecting sensitive information. In some cases, Proton’s services have even been instrumental in saving lives by enabling secure and private communications in high-risk situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton today supports over 100 million user accounts with a growing team of over 500 people from over 50 different countries, from the world&#39;s top companies and universities. We value intelligence, learning potential, and ambition in our hiring process. Adaptability is key as we navigate uncharted territories and redefine how business is conducted online. We believe smaller teams of exceptional talent will always prevail over larger teams with lower talent density. Proton has become profitable and reached scale without relying upon VC funding, largely due to superior talent that allows us to do things faster, more creatively, and more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global mindset and big ambitions but remain a start-up at heart. We value empowerment and flexibility and keep our structure flat to keep moving fast and avoid unnecessary politics. Tired of blending into the crowd? Join us and do work you can truly be proud of.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;df41d9b1-a4e5-469e-b94c-9c31cb38a786&quot;&gt;Check our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;social media pages&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to drive new B2B business for Proton in Switzerland. You will own the full sales cycle, from identifying and qualifying opportunities to negotiating and closing deals. You will build relationships with senior decision-makers, develop strategic partnerships across the Swiss business and public-sector ecosystems, and help grow Proton&#39;s presence in its home market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Creation &amp;amp; Strategic Opportunity Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and develop new strategic opportunities across target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build and manage your own pipeline of high-quality opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Balance long-term opportunity creation with closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify, engage, and develop partnerships with corporates, industry bodies, service providers and ecosystem partners (including co-selling opportunities)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Development (Switzerland Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Leverage your existing network within Swiss corporates and organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Expand Proton&#39;s presence within local business and public-sector ecosystems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify high-value entry points into target companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders (IT, security, leadership)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Act as a trusted advisor and entry point into organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Navigate complex organizational structures to identify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Sales Cycle Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Own the full sales cycle, from first contact to signed contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and qualify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Run discovery to understand use case, stakeholders and potential deal scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Negotiate and close deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Work closely with Sales leadership to align on target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Provide feedback on market opportunities and ICP evolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Share insights from partnerships and market interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• 3–7 years in Account Executive, Business Development or Strategic Sales roles, owning the full sales cycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven experience selling in the Swiss market (required)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Experience in B2B SaaS or technology environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven track record of generating pipeline and closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong existing network within Swiss companies and/or public-sector ecosystems (highly preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Appetite to develop and grow a network of Swiss customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong relationship-building and networking capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Ability to identify and develop strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong negotiation and closing skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Comfortable operating without a structured playbook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Fluent in Swiss German and English &lt;strong&gt;(required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• French is a strong plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Hunter mindset focused on opportunity creation and closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strategic thinker with strong commercial instincts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proactive, self-driven, and comfortable operating in ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Long-term relationship builder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Geneva, Zurich or remotely within Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check our social media to learn more about Proton:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/intent/user?screen_name=ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@ProtonAG&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LinkedIn-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoLab, we help mechanical engineering teams bring life-changing products to market years sooner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build AI for engineers designing cars, medical devices, and jet engines. Products this complex aren&#39;t sketched and sent to production. Teams spend months on iterations, reviews, and tests, predicting how every part performs before anything is built. CoLab is where those reviews happen, and we capture the rationale behind every change. Other tools show what changed between versions. Only CoLab knows why. That&#39;s how our AI helps manufacturers like Bobcat, Triumph Motorcycles, and GE Appliances make better decisions, eliminate rework cycles, and get to market faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proudly based in St. John’s, Newfoundland, CoLab started with one customer in 2018. Since then we’ve raised a&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/ai-is-changing-engineering-colab-just-raised-72m-to-lead-the-transformation&quot;&gt; $72M Series C&lt;/a&gt;, been named the 57th fastest growing company in North America by Deloitte (&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/colab-ranked-number-57-fastest-growing-company-in-north-america-on-the-2025-deloitte-technology-fast-500&quot;&gt;Fast 500™&lt;/a&gt;), signed multi-year&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-bombardier-signs-contract-colab-ai-software/&quot;&gt; AI partnerships with companies like Bombardier&lt;/a&gt;, and grown to a team of 250+.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role that helps define how CoLab delivers technical value to its most strategic customers in Aerospace and Defence. CoLab is a category-creating product, which means adoption isn&#39;t just a rollout. It&#39;s a change in how the organization works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;d act as a trusted advisor, leveraging people, process, and technology to help teams rethink how they manage feedback, data, and decision-making across design and PLM. That means getting deep into customer workflows, testing new ways of working, and building repeatable methods the rest of the team can scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside a Customer Success Manager, and use what you learn on the front line to help shape product direction. This role isn&#39;t about selling or pitching. It&#39;s about deeply understanding engineering problems and solving them alongside the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate in Switzerland to work regularly on-site with local CoLab customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Ideal Candidate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a mechanical engineer by trade and have worked as a designer in an A&amp;amp;D company. You also understand the full product development life cycle: how design, manufacturing, quality, and engineering leadership depend on each other, and where collaboration breaks down. You can coach those teams toward working together better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know how to improve that life cycle with technology. Maybe you’ve championed internal tools or created automation or scripts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also know a process that makes sense on paper won’t get adopted on its own. You can meet people where they are, including the stakeholders who don’t want to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the loudest voice in the room, but you can run a sprint and lead a cross-functional project. If the average person might find this job too undefined or complex, that probably excites you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping a customer&#39;s current-state design review and engineering workflows, and defining the target-state process their teams will actually adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying and tuning CoLab&#39;s AI capabilities against a customer&#39;s own standards, drawing checklists, and design guidelines, and diagnosing what&#39;s working and what isn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing mechanical engineering expertise to validate AI-generated results and ensure engineering rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and solving complex engineering data and integration challenges across PLM, ERP, QMS, and traditional design feedback tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding adoption into new teams, programs, and sites within the account, partnering with the Customer Success Manager on where the next opportunity sits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with product teams to identify feature gaps, improve capabilities, and refine AutoReview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mechanical design engineering, ideally in a medium- to large-sized organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of PLM &amp;amp; ERP systems and enterprise engineering data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical projects and cross-functional collaborations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or internal stakeholders to solve technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in fast-changing, ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication and documentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of high-level AI architecture, specifically LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, data integrations, and enterprise architecture concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in Switzerland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with internal tool development, scripting, or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI/ML tools applied to engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in design consulting or product development at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is a fully remote role, travel is a consistent part of the job. There are two primary types of travel you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Weeks:&lt;/strong&gt; Once per quarter, the sales team or entire company gets together in person. These typically involve traveling out on a Monday and returning on a Thursday or Friday. Two of these each year are held at our headquarters in St. John&#39;s, Newfoundland, Canada and the others take place in more central locations that evolve as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-sites:&lt;/strong&gt; This role will work closely with a local customer with expectations to be on site with that customer, so there will likely be far less travel than our typical MFDE roll. That being said, in the event the local customer were to no longer work with us, the following is our standard MFDE travel expectations: “For most of our large deployment customers, we will visit on-site during kick-off and key expansion opportunities. Most on-sites involve 2-3 days with the customer, with travel on either side. Travel is primarily within North America, and you can expect 4 customer on-sites per quarter.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Extra Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a full-time, permanent position with a competitive compensation package that includes stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid vacation and extended health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equity Note&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. We encourage you to help us break that statistic and apply even if you don&#39;t meet every single qualification. Your potential is what matters most to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IonQ is hiring a Senior Quantum Sales Director to drive new and expansion revenue for Capella Data as a Service (DaaS) and satellite systems across EMEA. You will own a portfolio of strategic enterprise, defence and government accounts, selling SAR imagery and analytics subscriptions, tasking capacity and complete satellite systems, and you will report to Garrick Ballantine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a quota carrying, hunter oriented role for a seller who can run long cycle capital programmes alongside faster moving data subscriptions, and who can translate space based sensing into mission and business outcomes. The role is remote, employed through an IonQ entity in the UK (Oxford) or Switzerland, with travel of up to 20%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own an annual new business and expansion quota across Capella DaaS subscriptions, tasking capacity and satellite system sales within an assigned enterprise, defence and civil government territory in EMEA. You will build and execute account plans for a named portfolio, mapping stakeholders across mission, programme, procurement and technical functions and building executive relationships at several levels in each account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sell the full value chain, from SAR data and analytics subscriptions and recurring tasking commitments to ground segment integration and dedicated or jointly owned satellite systems. Working with product, engineering and mission solutions teams, you will bring customer requirements back into the roadmap and represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex, consultative sales cycles from prospecting through to close, including discovery, technical validation with solutions engineering, pricing, contracting and negotiation of subscription and system purchase agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFIs, RFPs and government tenders in partnership with capture, proposal and contracts teams, and support prime and subcontractor teaming strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately in CRM, keep disciplined pipeline hygiene and deliver reliable monthly and quarterly commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across mission, programme, procurement and technical stakeholders in each account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial events across EMEA, and feed customer requirements back to product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring substantial enterprise sales experience in geospatial data, earth observation, satellite systems, defence technology or adjacent data and SaaS markets, with a consistent record of exceeding quota. You will have closed both recurring data or subscription contracts and large capital or programme based hardware sales, and you will have sold to EMEA and allied government, defence and security customers, with a working knowledge of their procurement frameworks and contracting cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have command of a structured sales methodology such as MEDDICC or Challenger, with disciplined CRM and forecasting rigour, and the ability to engage credibly with technical and mission stakeholders on remote sensing, SAR, tasking and data delivery workflows. A bachelor&#39;s degree in business, engineering or a related field, and willingness to travel up to 20%, are also required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience selling SAR, optical imagery or RF sensing data and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in satellite systems, ground segment or space mission integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in early market development or category creation for an emerging technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to obtain the relevant national security clearance in your country of employment, such as UK SC or NATO clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with EMEA government, defence or security customers, including NATO and allied programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive at Ripple Treasury, you will play a key role in our sales team, driving success in a high-growth region. This position offers an outstanding opportunity to work with a world-class team. You will help develop the future of corporate treasury by integrating modern technology with proven financial solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibility is to exclusively win new corporate clients for Ripple Treasury. This role requires effective positioning of a curated selection of the Ripple Treasury Platform&#39;s core capabilities to each target account, with end-to-end accountability for territory development and full deal lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve new business revenue goals set forth by Managing Director of Europe Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win corporate new accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop pipeline consistently across your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend trade shows, industry events, and user events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of your market and its evolving potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse and understand sales growth potential in your assigned territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about the treasury industry and competition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your manager and sales team to develop competitive strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a minimum of 10 days monthly in-office presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in New Business SaaS Sales, preferably in enterprise FinTech/Treasury Management Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated large account navigation and complex sales cycle management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to position functionally rich, sophisticated value propositions across multiple business areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to execute pipeline generation at scale through outbound, driving and maintaining a 4x pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record of top sales performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent value based, consultative selling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven organizational and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel 25-50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business or equivalent experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please find our California, UK/EU, Singapore, DIFC, ADGM, Australia, and Switzerland&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;for reference.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Garda Capital Partners (Garda) is a multi-billion dollar alternative investment firm with over 22 years of experience deploying relative value strategies across fixed income markets for institutional investors. We hire, grow, and mentor great talent and remain steadfast in our commitment to building a culture that helps them succeed. Garda is more than a workplace. We are built on trust, integrity, and a shared vision for how we work together, the enduring relationships we build, and the consistency of our results. Garda&#39;s primary offices are located in Wayzata, New York City, West Palm Beach, Geneva, Zug, Copenhagen, Singapore, and Scottsdale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Garda is seeking an Infrastructure Engineer to own Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Automation. This hands-on role builds and operates shared deployment capabilities for infrastructure and selected applications, while providing advanced infrastructure engineering and production support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The engineer develops reusable deployment pipelines, infrastructure templates, and self-service workflows that help teams provision environments and release changes consistently — working with architecture, application owners, and regional teams to improve platform reliability and resolve complex infrastructure problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Escalation &amp;amp; Infrastructure Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior escalation point for complex infrastructure incidents and recurring operational problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot across Windows/Linux systems, identity, networking, cloud, virtualization, storage, and backup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis and convert recurring incidents into engineering work or documented standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in major changes, recovery events, and follow-the-sun handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Deployment Automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automation using PowerShell, Python, and APIs with production-quality testing and error handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own reusable infrastructure-as-code and configuration templates (Terraform, Ansible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate CI/CD pipelines for infrastructure and applications, including validation, environment promotion, health checks, and rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Git, peer review, automated tests, change controls, and secure secrets handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Observability, Reliability &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve monitoring, logging, metrics, dashboards, alerting, and automated health checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tune operational signals to reduce noise and improve detection/recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain reusable provisioning workflows and self-service capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own platform reliability and lifecycle improvements with service owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and workplace technology staff in troubleshooting and automation practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review infrastructure code and pipeline designs with architecture, Security, and application owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain runbooks, diagrams, and onboarding guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a prioritized platform backlog with the architect and regional leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Desired Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–6 years of hands-on infrastructure operations experience across several domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in IT, computer science, computer engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced PowerShell or Python automation experience, including API integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with infrastructure as code or configuration management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and supporting CI/CD pipelines (Git, testing, secure deployment, rollback)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, root-cause analysis, and incident-response skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of monitoring, logging, alerting, and observability concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to document work, mentor others, and collaborate across a distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preference for experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS, container platforms, modern cloud operating patterns (Azure a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering reusable provisioning workflows for infrastructure and business applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ITSM, change, incident, and problem-management practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial services or another performance-sensitive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of solving complex infrastructure problems and building shared capabilities other teams can use independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of maintaining high standards for reliability, documentation, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience remaining effective under pressure, with a history of mentoring and knowledge-sharing within teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gardacp.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Candidate_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr Director, Head of Quality &amp;amp; Responsible Person, International, leads quality for infigratinib, and will be the designated Responsible Person on the entity&#39;s wholesale distribution authorisation. The role reports to the Head of Quality, QED, with a dotted line to local managing director, and is based in the Netherlands. If the entity becomes the marketing authorisation holder for infigratinib, the role also covers the related MAH quality duties. The role holds an unrestricted right of escalation to the entity&#39;s full board and is independent of commercial operations and of manufacturing/supply with EU-GDP guidelines, relevant EU directives (including the Falsified Medicines Directive), Dutch Medicines Act, and public service requirements. This role acts as a QA liaison of BridgeBio&#39;s contract service providers (CSPs), providing oversight of lot release activities. This role includes reviewing and approving batch records, certificates of analysis, and compliance documents, providing quality review of deviations, change controls, and CAPAs related to assigned CSPs, collaborating closely with CSPs and internal teams such as quality control, manufacturing, regulatory affairs, and supply chain. The role builds and leads a small quality team (deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, QA operations/GDP), owns the quality management system across the Skeletal Dysplasia assets, and leads WDA licensing, inspection readiness and potentially subsequent MIA readiness, if needed in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Major Responsibilities / Accountabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the named Responsible Person on the WDA: release for distribution, recall decisions, and GDP compliance of the entity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and develops the entity&#39;s quality team: deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, and QA operations/GDP; and QP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and improves the Quality Management System (QMS) across the entity&#39;s assets in alignment with the established QMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WDA application and IGJ inspection readiness; prepare subsequent MIA readiness (QP recruitment, import and batch-certification processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality agreement matrix: includes Quality oversight of contract service providers, 3PLs, distributors and intercompany interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a Quality liaison and provide oversight and quality support of assigned contract service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality review of assigned quality events such as deviations, change controls, supplier notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review master manufacturing batch records, including related documents such as specifications, analytical and microbiological methods, stability study protocols, and label proofs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage lot release activities and communication of lot release schedules to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate manufacturing deficiencies/non-conformances to management and work with CSPs to ensure timely resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review process and method validation protocols and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review analytical test results to ensure compliance with approved specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in updating CMC sections of regulatory and quality documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in internal and external project team meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other QA/Responsible Person related responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy of quality of records per GDP requirements including GDPs are implemented and maintained in the quality management system requirements for WDA license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and coordinate return, rejected, falsified products, recall operations of medicinal products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight of GDP and GMP activities of active pharmaceutical ingredients (API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure WDA and API registration is current with commercial supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and leads EU/ROW regulatory inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and oversee GMP vendor qualification program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the EU/ROW internal audit program, internal training program and ensure data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and review governing procedures as needed (e.g., SOPs, WIs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a Netherlands based remote role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel 30% of time is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who you are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS degree preferably in operations, science, pharmacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diploma, certificate, or other evidence of formal qualifications on completion of GDP/GDP-API training required for registration as an RP by the competent authorities in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in pharmaceutical quality, including significant GDP / distribution quality experience; prior appointment as (or eligibility to be) a Responsible Person strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading regulatory inspections with EU competent authorities (IGJ preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience of managing third party vendors (CMOs, CTLs, 3PLs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior relevant knowledge and experience related to the distribution of medical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain concepts, supplier management, inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of US/EU GMPs /GDPs and associated guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a highly regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of quality teams; experience building quality functions or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the EU and particularly IGJ regulations in relation to the wholesale distribution of medicines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and time management skills with ability to prioritize workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with keen attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in document and presentation office tools (Microsoft Office, Google Docs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of data concepts and enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems e.g., SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to embrace company core values and diverse corporate culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
