&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Global (NYSE: ZETA) is the AI-Powered Marketing Cloud that leverages advanced artificial intelligence (AI) and trillions of consumer signals to make it easier for marketers to acquire, grow, and retain customers more efficiently. Through the Zeta Marketing Platform (ZMP), our vision is to make sophisticated marketing simple by unifying identity, intelligence, and omnichannel activation into a single platform – powered by one of the industry’s largest proprietary databases and AI. Our enterprise customers across multiple verticals are empowered to personalize experiences with consumers at an individual level across every channel, delivering better results for marketing programs. Zeta was founded in 2007 by David A. Steinberg and John Sculley and is headquartered in New York City with offices around the world. To learn more, go to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zetaglobal.com&quot;&gt;www.zetaglobal.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Technical strategy and architecture. &lt;/strong&gt;Define the AI/ML architecture and technical roadmap across the portfolio. Identify shared capabilities, establish clear interfaces, and guide build-versus-buy decisions while respecting product-specific requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Predictive ML and optimization. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead advances in prediction, targeting, ranking, bidding, pacing, and personalization. Guide feature development, training, calibration, and serving, addressing sparse signals, delayed outcomes, and changing data distributions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Agentic frameworks and agents. &lt;/strong&gt;Design reusable orchestration, tool integration, retrieval, state and memory, and multi-agent coordination. Build workflows for campaign planning, insights, recommendations, and execution, with explicit permissions, human approval where needed, and recoverable failure handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Portfolio integration. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Predict, Agentic Frameworks, Email DSP/SSP, and agentic teams to connect models, data, and services through well-defined APIs and shared evaluation practices. Turn successful patterns into reusable components and practical migration paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Production engineering. &lt;/strong&gt;Own critical designs and implementations across data pipelines, training, deployment, and inference. Establish MLOps and LLMOps practices for reproducibility, versioning, automated testing, observability, and safe rollouts and rollbacks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Evaluation and business impact. &lt;/strong&gt;Define offline benchmarks and online experiments tied to advertiser outcomes. Evaluate prediction quality, calibration, agent task completion, tool accuracy, latency, and cost; use A/B testing and incrementality methods where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Reliability and responsible AI. &lt;/strong&gt;Set standards for service performance, drift detection, data quality, and incident response. Build privacy-aware data access, auditability, and protection against prompt injection, data leakage, and unintended agent actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with engineering, data science, product, and business leaders to turn ambiguous needs into deliverable plans. Lead design and code reviews, mentor senior engineers, and resolve technical decisions across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;12+ years of relevant software engineering and applied ML experience, or equivalent demonstrated expertise, including substantial ownership of production ML systems and technical leadership across multiple teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Deep expertise in predictive ML for ranking, recommendation, classification, or optimization, with strong foundations in statistics, experimentation, model evaluation, and the full model lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience delivering LLM applications and agentic workflows to production, including tool use, retrieval, orchestration, evaluation, guardrails, and operational monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to architect distributed, high-throughput, low-latency systems and make sound trade-offs across model quality, infrastructure cost, and operational complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Strong Python skills and proficiency in Java, Go, or a comparable backend language; experience with PyTorch or TensorFlow, SQL, and large-scale data or streaming systems such as Spark and Kafka.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, preferably AWS, containerization, CI/CD, model serving, and production observability; familiarity with relational, NoSQL, caching, and retrieval systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to influence without direct authority, communicate architectural decisions clearly, mentor experienced engineers, and translate business objectives into measurable technical outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;AdTech experience across DSPs, SSPs, real-time bidding, audience modeling, identity, attribution, or measurement; relevant experience in recommendation systems or marketplaces is also valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with causal inference, uplift modeling, contextual bandits, constrained optimization, or online learning in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with privacy-aware identity and audience systems, email advertising, or integrating ML capabilities across multiple products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience optimizing model and LLM inference, selecting and adapting models, or building reusable ML and agent platforms adopted by multiple teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PEOPLE &amp;amp; CULTURE AT ZETA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta considers applicants for employment without regard to, and does not discriminate on the basis of an individual’s sex, race, color, religion, age, disability, status as a veteran, or national or ethnic origin; nor does Zeta discriminate on the basis of sexual orientation, gender identity or expression.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to building a workplace culture of trust and belonging, so everyone feels invited to bring their whole selves to work. We provide a forum for employees to celebrate, support and advocate for one another. Learn more about our commitment to diversity, equity and inclusion here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a id=&quot;menur45rm&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ZETA IN THE NEWS!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving, and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious, and determined to do our best work together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is unique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central role at the core of &lt;strong&gt;Group Finance and consolidation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of the &lt;strong&gt;group consolidation process&lt;/strong&gt; in a multi-entity environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to complex &lt;strong&gt;technical accounting topics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility across Finance and close collaboration with Group Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong development path into senior roles within Group Accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the group consolidation process (&lt;strong&gt;in&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;OneStream&lt;/strong&gt;) across all entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform IFRS adjustments and technical accounting calculations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate and reconcile financial data from all legal entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency and integrity of group financial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver accurate and reliable data as basis for Group Financial Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in group accounting or consolidation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in &lt;strong&gt;Big4 or corporate accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with consolidation tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, analytical, and detail-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
