&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Redwood, we empower our customers with lights-out automation for their mission-critical business processes with industry leading products and platforms developed through an AI-Driven Software Development Life Cycle.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Redwood Software is the leading orchestration platform for the autonomous enterprise, driving business transformation at the lowest total cost of ownership. Redwood empowers organizations to intelligently automate and orchestrate mission-critical business and IT processes across complex ERP, hybrid cloud, data and emerging agentic AI systems. Through its SaaS-first automation fabric—with AI embedded across the automation lifecycle—Redwood accelerates the path to autonomous operations. Backed by 30 years of experience and trusted by more than 50% of the Fortune 50, Redwood helps organizations unlock human potential to focus on innovation, growth and what’s next.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORE VALUES&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One Team. One Redwood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make Your Own Weather&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess over Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the Problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respect Each Other&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer, you will be a senior technical leader and strategic influencer shaping Redwood’s RunMyJobs platform. You will drive high-impact technical decisions, own complex system designs, and lead initiatives that span teams and domains. Your work will translate business needs into scalable, resilient full-stack solutions that meet both functional and non-functional requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this fast-paced, agile environment, you will lead projects from concept through delivery, collaborating closely with product, design, engineering, finance, and customer success teams to ensure alignment and success. You will set the standard for engineering excellence by mentoring engineers at all levels and championing a culture of continuous improvement, innovation, and technical rigor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key part of this role is to ensure development teams follow best practices, coding standards, and technical requirements. You will provide hands-on technical guidance and architectural direction, including code and design reviews, while creating and maintaining design and code standards. Understanding, communicating, and enforcing Redwood’s software architecture strategy will be fundamental.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will proactively identify critical technical challenges related to quality, scalability, observability, and performance. By spotting early risks in architecture or implementation, you help prevent issues before they affect delivery or user experience. Leveraging data analysis, code reviews, and collaboration with cross-functional teams, you ensure that solutions are robust, efficient, and scalable, driving Redwood’s platform forward with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the Engineering manager for your teams and collaborate closely with Redwood’s Architecture team to ensure technical alignment, consistency, and strategic direction across the platform. As a key member of the engineering leadership group, you will influence architectural decisions and contribute to the evolution of our engineering strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with broad technical ownership and no direct people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture &amp;amp; Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and implementation of large-scale distributed systems, focusing on &lt;strong&gt;resilience, low-latency, and fault tolerance&lt;/strong&gt; within the Java ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompt Engineering for SDLC:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply advanced &lt;strong&gt;prompt engineering&lt;/strong&gt; techniques to maximize the efficacy of generative AI tools for writing comprehensive unit/integration tests, drafting technical documentation (Javadoc, API specs), and generating code refactoring suggestions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee and enhance automated build, test, and deployment pipelines (&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD, Kubernetes/Docker&lt;/strong&gt;) in a cloud environment (&lt;strong&gt;AWS/Azure/GCP&lt;/strong&gt;), leveraging AI tools for proactive anomaly detection and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborating with the product management team&lt;/strong&gt; to define, design, and implement new functionality that enhances Redwood&#39;s software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnosing and resolving&lt;/strong&gt; complex technical challenges and system issues to ensure platform reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;YOUR EXPERIENCE&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field. You should have over eight years of software development experience, with at least three to five years in a senior or staff software engineer role. This position requires proven experience in workload automation, job scheduling, and orchestration technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep proficiency in Java (11/17+)&lt;/strong&gt;, with strong experience in modern frameworks and libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in &lt;strong&gt;microservice architecture, containerisation (Docker, Kubernetes)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;RESTful API design.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with frontend technologies including &lt;strong&gt;ReactJS, MobX, &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; cloud platforms&lt;/strong&gt; such as &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Azure&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of database technologies (&lt;strong&gt;SQL, NoSQL, data modelling)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;DevOps practices&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;GitHub, Jira&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Bamboo&lt;/strong&gt; from Atlassian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in testing frameworks such as &lt;strong&gt;JUnit&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jest&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Playwright&lt;/strong&gt; with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;driving quality automation&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; testability by design&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment &lt;strong&gt;to engineering best practices&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;code reviews&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;static analysis&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;continuous quality improvements&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tool Fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated ability to proficiently use AI-powered developer tools (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Copilot&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Claude Code&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CodeWhisperer&lt;/strong&gt;) in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of evaluating and overriding AI-generated suggestions that are technically correct but architecturally flawed or non-compliant with security and performance best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompting Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing clear, contextual, and effective prompts for generative AI to produce usable code, tests, or documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of curiosity and a proactive approach to learning new AI tools and techniques that continuously reshape the development workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Architectural Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; The capacity to abstract away from low-level coding details to focus on &lt;strong&gt;high-value business logic and systemic architectural integrity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;css-1i27f3a&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ey7qxc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1s1axh3&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;jobPostingDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you like growth and working with happy, enthusiastic over-achievers, you&#39;ll enjoy your career with us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE LEGAL BIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redwood is an equal opportunity employer. Redwood prohibits unlawful discrimination based on race, colour, religion, sex, gender identity, marital or veteran status, age, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member), sexual orientation, pregnancy or any other consideration made unlawful by regional or local laws. We also prohibit discrimination based on a perception that anyone has any of those characteristics or is associated with a person who has or is perceived as having any of those characteristics. All such discrimination is unlawful and will have a zero tolerance policy applied to it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood will comply with all local data protection laws, including GDPR when it comes to the handling and processing of personal data. Should you wish for us to remove your personal data from our recruitment database, please email us directly at -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ben jij de influencer-goeroe die wij zoeken?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Volg jij de nieuwste features op Instagram, TikTok, YouTube en Snapchat op de voet? Weet jij precies welke influencers op dit moment hot zijn? Beheers je zowel het Nederlands als het Engels vloeiend? Dan maken we graag kennis met je!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dochteronderneming van WPP, het wereldwijde advertisingconglomeraat. We ondersteunen toonaangevende mediabureaus zoals Wavemaker, Mindshare en EssenceMediacom. Binnen WPP Media zijn verschillende centrale activiteiten ondergebracht, waaronder StudioM, Digital Data Hub, Business Intelligence, Proces Management, Marketing Services &amp;amp; Insights, Trading en Quality Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dynamische, jonge en ambitieuze organisatie met duizenden (young) professionals wereldwijd. In Nederland hebben we kantoren in Amsterdam, Eindhoven en Sittard. Daar werken honderden collega’s voor toonaangevende klanten zoals Action, Lamb Weston, NS, Subway, M&amp;amp;M’s, Brabantia, IKEA en Dr. Oetker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ons kantoor in Amsterdam biedt een adembenemend uitzicht van 180 graden over de stad en de Amstel. De sfeer is informeel en gezellig, met regelmatig vrijdagmiddagborrels in onze skybar op de negende verdieping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over StudioM en de functie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je gaat aan de slag bij StudioM, ons interne bureau voor influencer marketing. We voeren campagnes uit op grote, vaak internationale schaal. Je werkt met een breed scala aan klanten, influencers en campagnes, waardoor geen dag hetzelfde is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deze rol draag je zelfstandig de operationele verantwoordelijkheid voor complexe en omvangrijke projecten. Denk aan multi-marketprojecten, strategische accounts, campagnes voor meerdere merken en innovatieve trajecten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projectmanagement: Je bent zelfstandig verantwoordelijk voor het opzetten, uitvoeren en coördineren van influencer marketingcampagnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning en voortgang: Je stuurt de dagelijkse uitvoering aan, maakt duidelijke projectplanningen en bewaakt deadlines, afhankelijkheden, prioriteiten en de voortgang van projecten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencerselectie en briefings: Je vertaalt de kaders en briefings van de accountmanager naar concrete selectielijsten, taken en creatieve briefings, waaronder influencerbriefings. Waar nodig verdeel je taken onder junior collega’s of stagiairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relatiebeheer en onderhandelingen: Je onderhoudt relaties met influencers en talentbureaus en onderhandelt zelfstandig over marktconforme vergoedingen binnen het vastgestelde budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgetbeheer en administratie: Je beheert projectbudgetten en houdt kosten bij, zoals influencer fees, buy-outs en event- en productiekosten. Ook verzorg je contracten en regel je boekingen met bureaus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content en kwaliteit: Je bewaakt de voortgang en kwaliteit van alle content en deliverables, voert eerste contentchecks uit en werkt nauw samen met accountmanagers richting definitieve goedkeuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Afstemming en rapportage: Je werkt samen met interne teams om effectieve campagnes te realiseren. Je houdt klanten, stakeholders en de accountmanager proactief op de hoogte van de dagelijkse voortgang, sluit waar nodig aan bij klantupdates en rapporteert over resultaten en aandachtspunten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risicobeheersing en optimalisatie: Je signaleert risico’s, knelpunten en optimalisatiemogelijkheden, bespreekt deze met de (senior) accountmanager en escaleert tijdig waar nodig. Je stuurt actief bij, optimaliseert lopende campagnes en voert verbeteringen door met medior- en juniorcollega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluatie en begeleiding: Je levert inhoudelijke input voor projectevaluaties, vertaalt learnings naar verbeteringen voor toekomstige campagnes en begeleidt en werkt stagiairs in binnen het team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng je mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een passie voor influencer marketing en leeft social media. Je kijkt liever YouTube en TikTok dan televisie en denkt in Instagram Stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt de nieuwste features en ontwikkelingen op socialmediaplatformen en weet welke influencers op dit moment relevant zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je begrijpt hoe platformen als Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok en Snapchat werken en houdt hun innovaties bij.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent creatief, maar werkt ook gestructureerd en gecoördineerd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheerst het Nederlands en Engels vloeiend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ jaar ervaring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent hands-on en zorgt ervoor dat campagnes tot in de puntjes geregeld zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een boeiende baan in een vooruitstrevend en informeel team binnen een van de grootste communicatiegroepen ter wereld. Je krijgt de mogelijkheid om je talenten verder te ontwikkelen in een inspirerende werkomgeving. En natuurlijk werk je met fijne collega’s in ons geweldige kantoor, die iedere werkdag bijzonder maken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaris: €3.800 - €5.800&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(op basis van 38,75 uur per week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toegang tot M Academy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voor uitgebreide trainingen en workshops in zowel hard als soft skills, inclusief specifieke AI-trainingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken voor grote (internationale) merken en klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een zelfstandige rol met veel vrijheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De kans om een breder perspectief binnen influencer marketing en social media te ontwikkelen en kennis vanuit de wereld van mediabureaus op te doen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken binnen een energiek, ambitieus en gezellig team met focus op AI-transformatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open communicatie en een fijne werksfeer waarin iedereen zichzelf kan zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede arbeidsvoorwaarden en ontwikkelmogelijkheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een fijne kantoorplek op een mooie locatie in Amsterdam (Rivierenbuurt);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een team met veel kennis, kunde en gezelligheid;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vrijdagmiddag borrels en events op onze rooftop aan de Amstel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Toegang tot ons well being platform Telus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reiskostenvergoeding:&lt;/strong&gt; Reiskosten worden volledig vergoed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8% vakantiegeld en 26 vakantiedagen per jaar&lt;/strong&gt; (plus 9 extra bij te kopen!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; €30 netto per maand bij fulltime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Own Device (BYOD):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je ontvangt een maandelijkse telefoonvergoeding van €57,50 netto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaar voor de volgende stap in je carrière?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solliciteer nu en word onderdeel van ons ambitieuze team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE 📝&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Digital Marketing Manager to lead Form3’s digital growth and demand generation strategy, helping drive pipeline growth and brand development across our priority markets.&amp;nbsp;Reporting to the Marketing Director, you’ll combine strategic ownership with execution across integrated campaigns, account-based marketing, digital acquisition and performance measurement. You’ll also identify practical ways to use AI, automation and marketing technology to improve targeting, personalisation, efficiency and campaign results. You’ll work closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product and the wider Marketing team, aligning marketing activity with commercial priorities and identifying opportunities within strategic accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own Form3’s digital growth and demand generation strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create go-to-market plans for products, propositions, markets and strategic announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create integrated, multi-channel programmes that generate awareness, engagement, qualified leads and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build account-based marketing programmes for high-value prospects and strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI, automation and marketing technology to improve targeting, personalisation, lead generation and campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance across the marketing funnel and make insight-led recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve website performance, conversion rates, user journeys and marketing-driven engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR 🔍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years’ experience in B2B digital marketing, demand generation or campaign management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience developing campaign strategies and delivering integrated marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to link marketing investment to revenue growth and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in account-based marketing, audience segmentation, pipeline generation and campaign activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI, automation and marketing technology to improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong digital marketing capability across websites, landing pages, email, paid media, search and social, with the breadth and depth to lead an integrated digital strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and performance-reporting skills, combined with a commercial and customer-focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within technology, SaaS, Fintech or payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a start-up/scale-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience across multiple markets e.g. UK/Europe/NA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tooling such as Salesforce, Pardot, Salesloft, Cognism, ZoomInfo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INTERVIEW PROCESS ✍️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage One:&lt;/strong&gt; Screening Call with the Talent Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Two:&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with Marketing Director&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Three:&lt;/strong&gt; Case Study &amp;amp; Presentation with Marketing Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Four: &lt;/strong&gt;Interview with Head of Commercial Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We always aim to stick to the above process; however, there may be occasions when an additional interview stage is required for us to be sure we are hiring the right person!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HIRING LOCATIONS 📍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are the locations that we are hiring from for this position:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All new joiners start their first day in our office to collect the equipment needed to work remotely. We&#39;ll also arrange for some of your team to come in to say hi, ensuring you&#39;re supported and have a positive first few days with Form3!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS 🏝️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Form3 are a 100% remote, flexible business and are able to offer part-time working arrangements. We believe this enables our people to achieve amazing things with a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For further information on what it’s like to work here, and for more information on our full benefits package, visit our careers page. If you have any other questions, we’d be happy to discuss these with you during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FORM3 💭&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revolutionising the world of payments with our cloud-native, multi-cloud platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about Form3, check out the following pages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/platform&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;What we do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/culture&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life at Form3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Form3Cloud/podcasts&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Payments Cannot Fail Series&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techpodcast.form3.tech/episodes&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;.Tech Podcast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OUR DEI&amp;amp;B COMMITMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We hire talented people from a variety of backgrounds and experiences and are committed to a work environment based on diversity, open-mindedness and curiosity. We’re united by our company values (we even created them together!) and we celebrate our unique differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our employee lifecycle processes are designed to embrace equal opportunity and prevent discrimination against our people regardless of personal characteristics. It is our strong belief that the more inclusive and belonging we are as a business, the better our work will be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As an inclusive employer, we guarantee to interview all neurodiverse and physically disabled applicants who meet the minimum criteria for this role. We also encourage candidates to notify us of any reasonable adjustments that may be required during the recruitment process. This includes providing job adverts in alternative, accessible formats or adjustments required at interview stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you consider yourself to be neurodiverse or physically disabled under the UN definition of disability and would like to be considered under this scheme and/or require any reasonable adjustments please let us know by sending an email to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; clearly stating your consent for us to process this data. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For more information please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/legal/recruitment-data-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Data Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;📝&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Reporting &amp;amp; Data Analyst to help Form3 develop a more reliable, scalable and accessible reporting capability across the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a six-month fixed-term contract with two clear priorities: completing and enhancing the Customer Service reporting suite in AWS QuickSight, and building trusted, reusable datasets that enable teams to create and maintain their own reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll work across the business to improve data quality, reduce manual reporting and establish stronger documentation, governance and knowledge transfer for the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Complete and enhance the Customer Service reporting suite and reporting deck in AWS QuickSight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build and document reusable datasets for multiple reporting use cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Integrate key business systems into curated reporting datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Translate stakeholder questions into clear data and dashboard requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Establish consistent business metrics, definitions and reporting logic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Automate manual reporting and duplicated data preparation where possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
