&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMB Account Executive (Growth)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Growth Account Executive - SMB owns a book of business of existing SMB customers, where they are responsible for managing the customer relationship and drive revenue growth. This role focuses on driving customer adoption, understanding business pains and objectives, finding opportunities for growth and driving long-term account growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed expansion quota while deepening customer relationships and driving long-term account growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong understanding of customers’ business needs, organizational goals and GitLab utilization to assist them in achieving them and make recommendations / positioning products at each stage of the lifecycle - onboarding, adoption, renewal and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of and act as the CEO for your portfolio of SMB accounts:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans to identify and capitalize on expansion opportunities within Tier 1 accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular business reviews with customers to assess needs, demonstrate ROI, and uncover new use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of additional products and features, focusing on paid upgrades and add-ons including Duo products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the renewal process for Tier 1 customers, focusing on minimizing churn and maximizing contract value at renewal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build expansion pipeline through proactive outreach, leveraging growth signals and high-propensity indicators to source new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in signal-based selling in Tier 2 accounts; expand and close inbound deals&amp;nbsp; and identify upgrade and cross-sell opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Renewal Managers to close high-value renewals and ensure customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an accurate forecast for expansion and renewal revenue each quarter against your plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong ATR renewal rates and maximize gross booked ARR across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to root cause analyses on expansion wins/losses and churn events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate lessons learned to the team, including Customer Success, Renewals, Sales Development, and Product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, such as Customer Success, Renewals, Product, and Sales Development to provide account leadership and ensure exceptional customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date pipeline information in the CRM with detailed account notes and opportunity tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieving monthly and quarterly nARR targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience in account management or growth-focused sales, with a proven track record of exceeding expansion targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent discovery skills, ability to uncover and address customer pain points, negotiation, presentation and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in value-based selling, relationship building, and contract negotiation with existing customers. Strong analytical skills to identify account trends, usage patterns, and expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator with strong interpersonal skills and ability to conduct executive-level business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern sales tech stack including Salesforce, Clari, Outreach, ZoomInfo/Cognism, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Gong, and 6sense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of application lifecycle management including the technology commonly used in application lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be ready to learn how to use GitLab and Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focuses on continuously improving your professional skills with a focus on personal mastery and team learning through activities such as training, reading and seeking mentorship from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the company’s travel policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly desirable skill would be an additional language ie. German, Spanish, Dutch, French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-CM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To view the full job description and its compensation calculator, view our handbook. The compensation calculator can be found towards the bottom of the page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional details about our process can be found on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hiring page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;Remote-Global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Yubico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico is a global leader in identity security and creator of the YubiKey, the original hardware-backed passkey. We are publicly traded on Nasdaq Stockholm; our global footprint includes headquarters in Stockholm, Sweden, Silicon Valley, California; and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Our Mission?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Yubico, we are guided by a shared belief that your work matters. We operate under a cultural philosophy of &lt;em&gt;Speed with Integrity&lt;/em&gt;, pushing the boundaries of technology to secure the AI frontier—protecting both human and agentic AI interactions—and leading the transition to post-quantum cryptography. In everything we do, we live by our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Battle Friction:&lt;/strong&gt; We constantly look for new ways to simplify our products, our work, and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspire Higher:&lt;/strong&gt; We think big, champion the open internet, and strive to do the right thing even when it is difficult.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team:&lt;/strong&gt; We are open, responsive, and collaborative, overcoming challenges and celebrating our successes together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aligned with our commitment to open standards, we foster a thriving builder ecosystem through the&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.yubico.com/&quot;&gt; Yubico Developer Program&lt;/a&gt;, offering free&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.yubico.com/Software_Projects/&quot;&gt; open-source repositories&lt;/a&gt;, libraries, and SDKs to help developers rapidly integrate strong hardware authentication into any application. Through close collaborations with technical partners like Google, Microsoft, and Amazon, as well as newer frontiers like OpenAI, we continue to shape a safer digital world while donating security keys to protect vulnerable communities, journalists, and humanitarian groups worldwide through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/why-yubico/secure-it-forward/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure it Forward&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As cyber threats grow increasingly sophisticated, Yubico remains the proven standard in hardware-rooted, phishing-resistant security, trusted across the world’s leading technology firms, financial institutions, and critical infrastructure. We are advancing our GTM model beyond transactional hardware into a comprehensive, multi-pillar identity platform that bridges hardware root of trust with scalable subscription services (YubiKey as a Service) and modern digital identity capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Sales Director based in the United Kingdom (UK) to lead high-velocity enterprise expansion and secure strategic net-new accounts across the UK. Operating within a modern, data-driven sales architecture designed to minimize administrative drag and maximize customer-facing engagement, you will engage C-level security leaders, collaborate closely with strategic channel and advisory partners, and turn digital trust into lasting business resilience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Territory &amp;amp; Account Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate and execute a data-driven territory plan targeting named enterprise accounts, driving both net-new logo acquisition and deep expansion across key regulated verticals (including Financial Services, Technology, Manufacturing, and Critical Infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Full-Portfolio &amp;amp; Subscription Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion enterprise adoption across Yubico&#39;s hardware and software lifecycle solutions, accelerating customer transition toward predictable subscription models (YubiKey as a Service) and emerging identity platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex, multi-stakeholder negotiations and architect large-scale enterprise agreements that address organizational risk, regulatory compliance, and post-quantum cryptographic readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel &amp;amp; GSI Co-Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively partner with the UK Channel Manager, leading distributors, and Global System Integrators (GSIs) to generate partner-sourced demand, attach deployment services, and scale customer reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with BDRs, Solution Engineers, Customer Success Managers, and Professional Services to deliver an exceptional end-to-end customer journey from discovery through full-scale deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted strategic advisor to CXO-level security leaders (CISOs, CIOs, CTOs), representing Yubico’s mission at industry forums, executive roundtables, and customer advisory panels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating Excellence &amp;amp; Hygiene:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain disciplined pipeline health, accurate forecasting, and rigorous opportunity qualification (MEDDPICC), leveraging intelligent GTM tooling to prioritize high-intent, high-impact moves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Enterprise Sales Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive, demonstrable success as an enterprise account executive or sales director selling complex enterprise software, SaaS, or cybersecurity solutions to large corporate accounts in the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grounding in cybersecurity principles, particularly Identity and Access Management (IAM), Public Key Infrastructure (PKI), modern authentication standards (FIDO2 / WebAuthn), and zero-trust security frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Gravitas:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to command the room and lead consultative, business-outcome conversations with CISOs, CIOs, and enterprise risk committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM &amp;amp; Sales Tech Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience working proficiently within Salesforce (SFDC) or comparable enterprise CRM platforms, with a disciplined approach to pipeline management, opportunity tracking, and forecasting accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience co-selling alongside channel partners, value-added resellers, and global advisory/systems integration firms to multiply pipeline and accelerate deal velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Seller:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to articulate business value, TCO, and risk-reduction ROI beyond transactional hardware pricing, closing substantial multi-year subscription agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Resilient Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive, accountable approach to territory management that embodies transparency, team collaboration, and a relentless winning spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer, we value diversity and uphold an inclusive environment where all people feel that they are equally respected and valued. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, marital status, religion, national origin, disability, protected Veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law. We&#39;d love to learn about what you can add to our diverse team. We are an E-Verify Participating Employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico does not accept agency resumes or referrals so please do not send them to our careers staff or employees. Yubico is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes or referrals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data submitted through this form is used for managing Yubico’s recruitment activities, which include facilitating any application you make, setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing results and selecting candidates, and as otherwise needed in our recruitment and onboarding processes. The use of your personal data may also be necessary prior to entering into a contract with you (that is prior to offering you a job with Yubico). Your personal data will only be used for the purposes for which it was collected and in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/support/terms-conditions/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Yubico Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. We only keep your personal data for as long as necessary and in compliance with Yubico’s record retention policies. If you have asked us to, we will keep you informed of other opportunities at Yubico. We do this in various ways, including email and by phone. If at any time you do not want us to contact you or use your information as described herein please contact us at ----- to let us know and we will delete all such information. Providing your personal data is voluntary, but necessary to join our talent community, and if you do not agree to provide your data, we will not be able to consider you as part of our talent community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of providing the requested service, we will transfer your data to be processed by &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy-june-27-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Greenhouse Software Inc.&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;a service provider contracted by Yubico AB and/or its subsidiaries that meets legally mandated privacy requirements. The Yubico Privacy Notice offers more information about Yubico privacy practices, including the lawful basis for processing of personal data, how to lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority, and how to contact Yubico to exercise your data subject rights. In this notice, when we refer to &quot;Yubico&quot;, &quot;us&quot;, &quot;we&quot; or &quot;our&quot;, we mean the Yubico group company or companies that you apply to, or correspond with, and which are responsible for any personal data collected about you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your enthusiasm and knowledge of GIS customization to help build and test advancements to ArcGIS Arcade. Arcade is used by organisations around the world to customize their workflows, QA/QC data input, and create cutting edge visualisations. This is a fantastic opportunity to become part of the product development team and support the delivery of regular, high-quality releases in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us improve our Arcade functional capabilities, test routines, and documentation as part of the ArcGIS Pro development team developing Arcade. You’ll also collaborate with engineers on other products to ensure seamless integration across ArcGIS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri has a Relocation Assistance Program and can provide support with relocating to the Cardiff, UK area for this position. Check out more details of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/about-esri/cardiff-rd&quot;&gt;Esri R&amp;amp;D Center – Cardiff!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply curious, independent thought, and attention to detail to explore and understand the challenges that ArcGIS users face and provide usable, informative feedback on user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rich and varied GIS datasets and maps, sample applications and articles that can be used to highlight product capabilities, explain scripting functions, and guide scripting best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your development team, and teams across Esri, to design, create, and validate the newest datasets and GIS workflows to support visualisation, map labelling, pop-ups, attribute rules and verify the functionality meets user workflows and is consistent with Esri ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Describe GIS best practices and demonstrate how to apply these GIS workflows in internal team meetings, on product forums and websites, with customers, at Esri events, or in publications like the ArcGIS Blog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about and collaborate in AI code generation experiences to explore issues, investigate problems, and design and prototype enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build focused test code to represent complex situations for investigation and regression testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer, automate, and manage online and database GIS systems and services to support the development of new product features and ongoing product releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of GIS experience (such as modeling, analyzing, or presenting geospatial data in a scientific, engineering, governmental, or post graduate academic environment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with mapping, spatial data or GIS platforms such as ArcGIS or QGIS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytic skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven initiative and creativity to find ways to explore, investigate, test and validate software behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of, and interest in, scripting or coding to appreciate our end users&#39; challenges and to communicate effectively with the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and team collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, geography, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing work authorisation for the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and passion for working with cartography, mapping or geospatial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or knowledge of AI code generation and development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of user communication and education such as having been responsible for product documentation, blogs, written or video tutorials, presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity using version control systems such as Git, for documentation and code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with some of the scripting or coding languages such as Python, Lua, JavaScript, Perl, or Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in GIS, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is one component of our total rewards strategy. Compensation decisions and the base range for this role take into account many factors including but not limited to skill sets; experience and training; licensure and certifications; and other business and organizational needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reasonable estimate of the base salary range is £37,080 - £58,092.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EL1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Esri, diversity is more than just a word on a map. When employees of different experiences, perspectives, backgrounds, and cultures come together, we are more innovative and ultimately a better place to work. We believe in having a diverse workforce that is unified under our mission of creating positive global change. We understand that diversity, equity, and inclusion is not a destination but an ongoing process. We are committed to the continuation of learning, growing, and changing our workplace so every employee can contribute to their life’s best work. Our commitment to these principles extends to the global communities we serve by creating positive change with GIS technology. For more information on Esri’s Racial Equity and Social Justice initiatives, please visit our website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/racial-equity/overview#engage-communities&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you don’t meet all of the preferred qualifications for this position, we encourage you to still apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri is an equal opportunity employer (EOE) and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the employment process, please email &lt;a ---------- and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information. Please note that only those inquiries concerning a request for reasonable accommodation will be responded to from this e-mail address.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/privacy/overview&quot;&gt;Esri Privacy&lt;/a&gt; Esri takes our responsibility to protect your privacy seriously. We are committed to respecting your privacy by providing transparency in how we acquire and use your information, giving you control of your information and preferences, and holding ourselves to the highest national and international standards, including CCPA and GDPR compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your enthusiasm and talents to Esri, creating&amp;nbsp;industry leading&amp;nbsp;ArcGIS products. The ArcGIS Maps SDKs allow developers to build modern mapping applications for mobile and desktop platforms, with 2D and 3D data&amp;nbsp;visualisation, and online or offline access. This is a fantastic opportunity to join the product development team and support the delivery of regular, high-quality releases in a collaborative and dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us improve our cross-platform GIS software libraries, built on the latest compilers and C++ standards, and create sample apps, developer documentation, and developer outreach.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri has a Relocation Assistance Program and can provide support with relocating to the Cardiff area for this position. Check out more details of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/about-esri/cardiff-rd&quot;&gt;Esri R&amp;amp;D Center – Cardiff!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply curious, independent thought, and attention to detail to explore and understand the challenges that ArcGIS users face and provide usable, informative feedback on user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer, who are software developers, gathering requirements and use cases that translate into actionable code and doc improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rich and varied GIS datasets and maps, sample applications and articles that can be used to highlight product capabilities, explain&amp;nbsp;APIs&amp;nbsp;and guide user (developer) practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your development team, and teams across Esri, to design, create, and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;the newest datasets and GIS workflows to support field mapping, data collection, spatial analysis and verify the functionality meets user workflows and is consistent with Esri ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Describe GIS best practices and&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;how to apply these GIS workflows in internal team meetings, on product forums and websites, with customers, at Esri events, or in publications like the ArcGIS Blog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document technical topics and concepts, and produce developer-focused product documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about and collaborate in SDK environments (such as Kotlin, Qt, C#, Swift, Flutter, Python), to explore issues, investigate problems, and design and prototype enhancements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build focused test code to&amp;nbsp;represent&amp;nbsp;complex situations for investigation and regression testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer, automate, and manage online and database GIS systems and services to support the development of new product features and ongoing product releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of GIS experience (such as modeling, analyzing, or presenting geospatial data in a scientific, engineering, governmental, or post graduate academic environment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with mapping, spatial data or GIS platforms such as ArcGIS or QGIS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytic skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven initiative and creativity to find ways to explore, investigate,&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;software behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and team collaboration skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of, and interest in, scripting or coding to appreciate our developer users&#39; challenges and to communicate effectively with the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, geography, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing work authorisation for the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and passion for working with cartography,&amp;nbsp;mapping&amp;nbsp;or geospatial data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or knowledge of layout, typography, and fonts for international text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of user communication and education such as having&amp;nbsp;been responsible for&amp;nbsp;product documentation, blogs, written or video tutorials, presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity using version control systems such as Git, for documentation and code&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with some of the scripting or coding languages which our SDKs target, and which we use for automation, such as using Kotlin, Qt, .Net, Swift, Flutter, Typescript or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in GIS, computer science, engineering, or related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is one component of our total rewards strategy. Compensation decisions and the base range for this role take into account many factors including but not limited to skill sets; experience and training; licensure and certifications; and other business and organizational needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reasonable estimate of the base salary range is £37,080 - £58,092.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EL1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Esri, diversity is more than just a word on a map. When employees of different experiences, perspectives, backgrounds, and cultures come together, we are more innovative and ultimately a better place to work. We believe in having a diverse workforce that is unified under our mission of creating positive global change. We understand that diversity, equity, and inclusion is not a destination but an ongoing process. We are committed to the continuation of learning, growing, and changing our workplace so every employee can contribute to their life’s best work. Our commitment to these principles extends to the global communities we serve by creating positive change with GIS technology. For more information on Esri’s Racial Equity and Social Justice initiatives, please visit our website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/racial-equity/overview#engage-communities&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you don’t meet all of the preferred qualifications for this position, we encourage you to still apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri is an equal opportunity employer (EOE) and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the employment process, please email &lt;a ---------- and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information. Please note that only those inquiries concerning a request for reasonable accommodation will be responded to from this e-mail address.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/privacy/overview&quot;&gt;Esri Privacy&lt;/a&gt; Esri takes our responsibility to protect your privacy seriously. We are committed to respecting your privacy by providing transparency in how we acquire and use your information, giving you control of your information and preferences, and holding ourselves to the highest national and international standards, including CCPA and GDPR compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE (this is 12 month maternity cover contract!)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Transactional Finance Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead the teams responsible for the operational finance activities that underpin Gymshark&#39;s working capital performance, with ownership of &lt;strong&gt;Inventory, Accounts Receivable and Accounts Payable accounting and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible leadership role that combines technical accounting expertise, commercial acumen and operational excellence. You&#39;ll partner with senior stakeholders across the business to optimise working capital, improve financial processes and drive automation and efficiency across our finance function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in ensuring robust financial control whilst enabling continued growth across a fast-paced, global business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BE DOING.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and developing our Inventory and Transactional Finance teams, creating a high-performing and engaged environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the finance processes and reporting associated with inventory, accounts receivable and accounts payable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the development and execution of Gymshark&#39;s working capital strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and implementing process improvements and automation opportunities across transactional finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering the annual roadmap and priorities for the Transactional Finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with stakeholders across the business to improve working capital performance and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Producing insightful financial analysis, KPI reporting and balanced scorecard metrics to support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting major business initiatives and investment opportunities through detailed cost-benefit analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with senior leadership to drive improvements in financial performance and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting company-wide budgeting and planning activities relating to working capital management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading audit activity relating to working capital balances and ensuring accurate, timely delivery of audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually reviewing controls, processes and governance to ensure a best-in-class finance environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL NEED.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fully qualified accountant (ACA, ACCA, CIMA or equivalent).Significant experience leading and developing finance teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical accounting knowledge combined with commercial awareness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to influence and challenge senior stakeholders constructively.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical capabilities with a passion for using data to drive improvements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exceptional systems and IT skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to perform effectively in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong integrity and commitment to governance and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working with NetSuite and/or SAP.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Previous responsibility for working capital management within a similarly sized organisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Retail and/or e-commerce experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting businesses through periods of rapid growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role and requires the successful candidate to attend at least&lt;strong&gt; 3 days a week in GSIQ, Solihull, UK&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BELONGING AT GYMSHARK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to be a place where everyone belongs. We’re an equal opportunities employer, and for us that means we always strive to be as inclusive as possible in all aspects of employment, right from your application. We’re committed to finding reasonable adjustments* for candidates with specific needs or have a disability during our recruitment process, and all applicants will be considered fairly and equally. We do not tolerate discrimination of any kind. *If you’d like to request a reasonable adjustment please email &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re here to unite the conditioning community. We believe that putting the sweat in today, prepares us for tomorrow. So, we give people the tools they need to reach further, go faster, be stronger. We celebrate those who show up – for themselves – to be their physical or mental best, whatever that means for them. It’s what we want for our community, and our team. A team that’s growing rapidly around the world. A collective of talented individuals working together to invent Gymshark’s future. Our plans are ambitious, and we’re looking for people who want to join us for the ride – our growth will be your growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE PERKS.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-based Bonus opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funded Healthcare benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday, additional day for your birthday &amp;amp; Bank Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Employer pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible benefits programme – including salary sacrifice EV scheme, dental insurance, cycle to work, tech scheme, holiday trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gymshark Employee Discount &amp;amp; long service awards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to High Street cashback and discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial, Physical and Mental Wellbeing Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Office location specific benefits include (IQ):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym Membership to The Lifting Club (LC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite lunch provision &amp;amp; coffee bars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EV charge points available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; The bonus program and benefits have certain eligibility requirements. Gymshark reserves the right to amend these programs in whole or in part at any time without advance notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLOSING DATE - 2nd October&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP | WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP is part of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5677231c-455b-4705-9250-42d6515234fb&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do you have strong data and analytical skills, with a passion for shaping business strategy? Can you architect, build, and apply modern data models to deliver impactful marketing insights? Are you seeking an exciting role with significant opportunities for leadership and growth? Then you might be the Senior Data Insights Consultant we are looking for!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will your day look like?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As our new Senior Data Insights Consultant, you will join our growing Technology and Data team. Here, you will be a key leader in helping our clients make data-driven decisions to enhance their digital communication on an enterprise scale. This entails designing, enabling, and delivering complex data solutions and integrations for various campaign platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;More&amp;nbsp;specifically,&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;tasks&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Architecting, building, and delivering value-adding insights solutions, serving as a key advisor to clients on how to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;their data assets to&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;large-scale communication strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Performing advanced analysis to uncover actionable patterns, trends, and opportunities that directly inform client strategy and decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Designing and running test-and-learn&amp;nbsp;programs (A/B tests, incrementality, holdouts) across channels to measure impact and continuously&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;communication performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partnering with senior stakeholders to define strategic business questions and&amp;nbsp;translating&amp;nbsp;them into robust analytical frameworks and data roadmaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Supporting or leading the data-stream on complex, large-scale projects with globally&amp;nbsp;recognised&amp;nbsp;brands, ensuring that data solutions and integrations are designed and delivered for scalability and business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Driving ongoing proactive client ideation —&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;new opportunities, use cases, and data-driven initiatives that help clients grow their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping&amp;nbsp;drive agentic AI adoption, exploring and embedding agentic solutions into our data and insights workflows to enhance efficiency and client value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Providing answers and&amp;nbsp;insights&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;business-related questions via automated reporting solutions as well as ad-hoc data analyses, including building reports and&amp;nbsp;insights&amp;nbsp;dashboards within marketing platforms such as Adobe and Salesforce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mentoring, reviewing, and advising less senior team members — elevating quality, fostering technical excellence, and supporting their professional growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;10&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborating with highly skilled specialists including Account Managers, Architects, Developers, Creatives, Strategists, Data Scientists and Marketing Operations experts to service our clients coherently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who are you going to work with?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will join a team of hands-on Data Insights Consultants, Data Scientists and Data Engineers who are passionate about bringing value and knowledge from data. We are all about unlocking insights from data through analytics and making that insight applicable in 1:1 data-driven communication and CRM. Your work will always be firmly anchored in data in a cross-disciplinary setting, collaborating closely with highly enthusiastic experts from Strategy or Creative backgrounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What do you bring to the table?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a person, you&amp;nbsp;possess&amp;nbsp;a strong consultancy mindset,&amp;nbsp;demonstrating&amp;nbsp;resilience, curiosity, and an eager-to-learn attitude. You combine this with strong business acumen, allowing you to understand and&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;client needs effectively. You are outgoing and love being part of interdisciplinary projects and solutions. You are eager to learn and quick to understand the complexity of high-tech dialogues and solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Furthermore, you have the drive, enthusiasm, and technical credibility to act as the primary data and insights advisor for senior client leadership, guiding them through complex challenges and inspiring them to grow their business.&amp;nbsp;It&#39;s&amp;nbsp;an advantage if you have consulting, agency&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;or marketing domain knowledge, but&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In addition, you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A minimum of 5 years of experience in a consultant/business liaison role related to data, BI, analytics or reporting solutions. Can independently design, build, and&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;modern analytics solutions that are scalable, maintainable, and ready for real-world production use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
