&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Applications are now open for our January cohort - &lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/afpsafety&quot;&gt;apply here by October 30.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anthropic Fellows Program overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Anthropic Fellows Program is designed to foster AI research and engineering talent. We provide funding and mentorship to promising technical talent - regardless of previous experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fellows will primarily use external infrastructure (e.g. open-source models, public APIs) to work on an empirical project aligned with our research priorities, with the goal of producing a &lt;strong&gt;public output&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. a paper submission). In one of our earlier cohorts, over 80% of fellows produced papers.&amp;nbsp;We run multiple cohorts of Fellows each year and review applications on a rolling basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 months of full-time research&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct mentorship from Anthropic researchers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a shared workspace (in either Bay Area, California, Toronto, Canada, or London, UK)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connection to the broader AI safety and security research community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly stipend of 4,615 USD / 3,440 GBP / 6,470 CAD / 4,110 EUR + benefits (these vary by country)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funding for compute (~$15k/month) and other research expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process will include an initial application &amp;amp; reference check, technical assessments &amp;amp; interviews, and a research discussion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed. Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected base stipend for this role is 4,615 USD / 3,440 GBP / 6,470 CAD / 4,110 EUR per week, with an expectation of 40 hours per week for 4 months (with possible extension).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Across the workstreams, you may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by making sure AI is safe and beneficial for society as a whole&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited to transition into empirical AI research and would be interested in a full-time role at Anthropic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong technical background in computer science, mathematics, or physics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced, collaborative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can implement ideas quickly and communicate clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in a discipline relevant to a specific Fellows workstream (e.g. economics, social sciences, or cybersecurity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in areas of research or engineering related to their workstream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates must be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Python programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available to work full-time on the Fellows program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Safety Fellows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentors, research areas, &amp;amp; past projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fellows will undergo a project selection &amp;amp; mentor matching process. Potential mentors include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sam Bowman&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sara Price&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alex Tamkin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nina Panickssery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trenton Bricken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logan Graham&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jascha Sohl-Dickstein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joe Benton&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collin Burns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fabien Roger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samuel Marks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kyle Fish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ethan Perez&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mentors will lead projects in select AI safety research areas, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scalable Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Developing techniques to keep highly capable models helpful and honest, even as they surpass human-level intelligence in various domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adversarial Robustness and AI Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Creating methods to ensure advanced AI systems remain safe and harmless in unfamiliar or adversarial scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Organisms:&lt;/strong&gt; Creating model organisms of misalignment to improve our empirical understanding of how alignment failures might arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Internals / Mechanistic Interpretability:&lt;/strong&gt; Advancing our understanding of the internal workings of large language models to enable more targeted interventions and safety measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Welfare:&lt;/strong&gt; Improving our understanding of potential AI welfare and developing related evaluations and mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Alignment Science&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://red.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Frontier Red Team&lt;/a&gt; blogs, you can read about past projects, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/subliminal-learning/&quot;&gt;Subliminal Learning: Language Models Transmit Behavioral Traits via Hidden Signals in Data:&lt;/a&gt; Alex Cloud and Minh Le, et al., mentors including Samuel Marks and Owain Evans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/open-source-circuit-tracing&quot;&gt;Open-source circuits:&lt;/a&gt; Michael Hanna and Mateusz Piotrowski with mentorship from Emmanuel Ameisen and Jack Lindsey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a full list of representative projects for each area, please see these blog posts: &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/2024/anthropic-fellows-program/#:~:text=We&#39;re%20launching%20the%20Anthropic,time%20on%20AI%20safety%20research.&quot;&gt;Introducing the Anthropic Fellows Program for AI Safety Research&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/recommended-directions/&quot;&gt;Recommendations for Technical AI Safety Research Directions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique candidate criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might be a particularly great fit for this workstream if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by reducing catastrophic risks from advanced AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with empirical ML research projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience working with large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in one of the research areas mentioned above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of open-source contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Security Fellows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentors, research areas, &amp;amp; past projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fellows will undergo a project selection &amp;amp; mentor matching process. Potential mentors include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nicholas Carlini&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keri Warr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evyatar Ben Asher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keane Lucas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newton Cheng&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Alignment Science&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://red.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Frontier Red Team&lt;/a&gt; blogs, you can read about some past Fellows projects, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://red.anthropic.com/2025/smart-contracts/&quot;&gt;AI agents find $4.6M in blockchain smart contract exploits:&lt;/a&gt; Winnie Xiao and Cole Killian, mentored by Nicholas Carlini and Alwin Peng&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/strengthening-red-teams/&quot;&gt;Strengthening Red Teams: A Modular Scaffold for Control Evaluations:&lt;/a&gt; Chloe Loughridge et al., mentored by Jon Kutasov and Joe Benton&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique candidate criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might be a particularly great fit for this workstream if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by reducing catastrophic risks from advanced AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have contributed to open-source projects in LLM- or security-adjacent repositories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have demonstrated success in bringing clarity and ownership to ambiguous technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with pentesting, vulnerability research, or other offensive security work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a demonstrated willingness to do the &quot;dirty work&quot; that produces high-quality outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have reported CVEs or been awarded bug bounties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with empirical ML research projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with deep learning frameworks and experiment management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics Requirements: &lt;/strong&gt;To participate in the Fellows program, you must have work authorization in the US, UK, or Canada and be located in that country during the program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workspace Locations:&lt;/strong&gt; We have designated shared workspaces in London and Berkeley where fellows will work from and mentors will visit. &lt;strong&gt;We are also open to remote fellows in the UK, US, or Canada&lt;/strong&gt;. We will ask you about your availability to work from Berkeley or London (full- or part-time) during the program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visa Sponsorship: &lt;/strong&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; currently able to sponsor visas for fellows. To participate in the Fellows program, you need to have or independently obtain full-time work authorization in the UK, the US, or Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;The program runs for 4 months, full-time. If you can&#39;t commit to the full duration, please still apply and note your constraints in the application. We review these requests on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; We do not guarantee that we will make any full-time offers to fellows. However, strong performance during the program may indicate that a Fellow would be a good fit for full-time roles at Anthropic. In previous cohorts, 25-50% of fellows received a full-time offer, and we’ve supported many more to go on to do great work on AI safety and security at other organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications and interviews are managed by &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://www.constellation.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Constellation&lt;/a&gt;, our recruiting and program partner. Constellation also runs the Berkeley workspace and provides program support for fellows working on AI safety and security; fellows on capabilities-focused projects are supported directly by Anthropic. All applicants currently use the same application portal but we are working to separate applications for safety/security and capabilities-focused projects in future rounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/afpsafety&quot;&gt;Apply here by October 30.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;The below are Anthropic&#39;s policies for full-time roles. These do &lt;strong&gt;NOT&lt;/strong&gt; apply to the Fellows Program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Regional Director in the Sales and Go-to-Market department. The Sales and Go-to-Market team is a global group of professionals who are passionate about delighting our customers, nurturing trusted partnerships, and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will focus on expanding our footprint across the French market, demonstrating the power and agility of cloud transformation to enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage an assigned territory focused on net new logo and upsell opportunities across the French market, mainly covering Public sector accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth by selling into Enterprise level accounts (2000-10,000 users)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales Engineering, Solution Architecture, Value Consulting, and Transformation Teams throughout your sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working with enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building new logos from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience navigating and selling within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a complex SaaS solution and leading complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence tools or positioning AI-driven cloud security architectures to enterprise clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Sector experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cyber security experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-FO1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll (Working Student)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the team&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, our People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team is the engine behind a smooth and reliable employee experience. We manage the full employee lifecycle — from onboarding and contract changes through to offboarding — while supporting accurate and timely payroll across Southern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In France, recurring operational work is growing across employee lifecycle administration, field sales hiring and payroll coordination. You’ll join a hands-on, detail-driven team where operational excellence and employee care go hand in hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Working Student position supporting the People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team in France. You’ll take ownership of recurring administrative and payroll support tasks, help keep our data accurate and up to date, and make sure employees and managers get timely, clear support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great entry point into HR and payroll operations for someone who is organised, reliable, and eager to build real expertise in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payroll support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to collect, and organise payroll input data ahead of monthly deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support follow-up with external payroll and benefits providers where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain accurate payroll records and flag missing information or discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HR administration &amp;amp; employee lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, update, and archive employment contracts and employee documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding, contract changes, and offboarding processes — ensuring data accuracy and completeness at every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with benefits administration where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee support &amp;amp; ticket handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to routine employee and manager queries via internal systems and email with clarity and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage open tickets and follow up, escalating more complex cases when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data management &amp;amp; process improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update employee data in HR systems and Excel / Google Sheets trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular data checks and keep Notion pages and internal documentation up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive steps, data-quality issues, or bottlenecks in recurring workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest small process improvements that make day-to-day operations more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in HR, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English — clear written and verbal communication is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy, especially with sensitive employee and payroll data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Excel / Google Sheets skills and confidence working with structured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — able to manage recurring tasks and meet regular deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling confidential information with discretion and good judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to learn new tools and systems — we work across multiple HR platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a hands-on, service-oriented attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Previous experience or studies in HR, payroll administration, or people operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interest in payroll processes, HR systems, or process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Familiarity with AI tools such as ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why SumUp?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎&amp;nbsp; Work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Barcelona office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈&amp;nbsp; Be part of a workplace that values diversity and inclusion, where every perspective is respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;❤️&amp;nbsp; Access our Employee Assistance Programme for mental health guidance and support when you need it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;En bref&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prêt(e) à piloter l’excellence du service client chez Picnic ? Dans une équipe constituée de 3 autres Superviseurs et sous la responsabilité de nos Managers des Opérations, tu encadres une équipe de 25 Chargé(e)s de clientèle et tu assures la fluidité de nos opérations sur tous nos canaux. Entre coaching, résolution de cas complexes et collaboration étroite avec les équipes en entrepôts, ton impact est immédiat. Une fois le quotidien maîtrisé, tu prends les commandes de projets transverses pour optimiser nos processus et réinventer l’expérience client. Tu veux passer à la vitesse supérieure ? Envoie-nous ton CV et rencontrons-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encadrement des Chargé(e)s de clientèle&lt;/strong&gt; : Recruter, former et encadrer une équipe diversifiée d’agents du service client pour garantir un service de qualité;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage opérationnel quotidien&lt;/strong&gt; : Assurer la fluidité du service sur tous nos canaux (WhatsApp, e-mails, appels), tout en garantissant un bon suivi des KPIs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion de crise &lt;/strong&gt;: Être le/la premier(e) interlocuteur(rice) sur les cas complexes, tu coordonnes les solutions avec les entrepôts pour transformer chaque incident en succès client;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exécution de projets d&#39;amélioration&lt;/strong&gt; : Mener à bien des projets pour optimiser les performances de l&#39;équipe;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimisation continue&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu analyses les retours terrains pour améliorer nos processus internes et l&#39;ergonomie de notre application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour assurer une présence continue à nos clients tout en préservant ton équilibre, ton planning s’articule autour de trois rythmes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts opérationnels&lt;/strong&gt; : Soit au bureau de &lt;strong&gt;8h à 16h&lt;/strong&gt;, soit en télétravail de &lt;strong&gt;15h à 23h&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts projets&lt;/strong&gt; : Des journées au bureau de &lt;strong&gt;10h à 18h&lt;/strong&gt; pour te concentrer sur l&#39;amélioration de nos services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La présence week-end &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures &lt;strong&gt;3&amp;nbsp;week-ends&lt;/strong&gt; par mois, intégralement en &lt;strong&gt;télétravail&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es titulaire au minimum d&#39;un diplôme de niveau Bac +2 en relation client, management ou autre domaine équivalent ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu disposes d&#39;une expérience de 1 à 3 ans en management d&#39;équipes opérationnelles, de préférence en service client ou autre domaine similaire ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le français et l&#39;anglais de sorte à pouvoir t’impliquer dans des projets d’envergure internationale ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En cas d’urgence, tu gardes ton sang-froid et gères les priorités efficacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 &lt;strong&gt;Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profite d&#39;un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achat, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu profiteras aussi d&#39;inviations à tous nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚲 &lt;strong&gt;Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu te rends au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍️ &lt;strong&gt;Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à un environnement dynamique, jeune et international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour en apprendre davantage sur Picnic, rends-toi sur notre page&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Welcome to the Jungle&lt;/em&gt; en cliquant&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/fr/companies/picnic&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ici&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IkZNKGYreOU&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Artefact is an AI-native company fusing engineering-grade delivery with strategic consulting to drive high-impact results. We specialize in accelerating end-to-end data and AI transformation, helping enterprises turn marketing into a predictable engine for business growth across the value chain. From strategy to implementation, Artefact delivers bespoke, scalable AI solutions tailored to our clients&#39; core business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Paris, Artefact operates across 27 countries with a global team of over 2,500 employees, partnering with leading international brands across luxury, retail, FMCG, industry, healthcare, and finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our rapid expansion, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Marketing team starting in &lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt; for a minimum of 6 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about B2B marketing, tech innovation, and generative AI? Do you want to work in an environment where your contributions directly accelerate business growth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a central role in driving Artefact’s flagship initiative: &lt;strong&gt;&quot;AI-Augmented Marketing&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. This global project reshapes how our international marketing teams operate by embedding analytical rigor, agentic AI workflows, and operational excellence into everyday execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly alongside the Group CMO, you will collaborate closely with regional marketing teams, data scientists, and business analysts worldwide. Fluency in English is essential, as you will lead international workshops, align stakeholders, and scale best practices across all Artefact entities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Group CMO in executing the global &lt;em&gt;AI-Augmented Marketing&lt;/em&gt; roadmap across three core pillars :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Derive actionable insights from the marketing data platform to guide executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic content workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate content operations by building and deploying an AI skill/agent library using tools such as Gemini Enterprise, Claude, and Lovable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Scale adoption across international hubs by designing learning modules, documenting playbooks, and running hands-on training sessions in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market &amp;amp; revenue operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI tools and skills to optimize inbound and outbound funnels, drive pipeline velocity, and enhance Marketing-Sales alignment for sustained lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance measurement &amp;amp; reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and optimize full-funnel B2B performance dashboards (awareness, activation, ABM) to measure campaign ROI and surface continuous improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and update cross-functional tracking tools, operational dashboards, and meeting cadences to maintain project momentum and organizational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-impact copywriting &amp;amp; editorial:&lt;/strong&gt; Produce high-converting editorial assets (internal/external newsletters, landing pages, case studies, and thought leadership articles) while safeguarding brand tone and positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Master’s student from a top-tier Business School (&lt;em&gt;Grande École de Commerce&lt;/em&gt;) or equivalent university program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong data-driven problem-solving abilities; comfortable working with analytics platforms, data modeling, and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Tech native:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine passion for emerging technologies, generative &amp;amp; agentic AI tools, and B2B growth marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; copywriting:&lt;/strong&gt; Bilingual or fluent in English (both written and spoken) with exceptional writing skills across long-form, web, and newsletter formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; High organizational agility, rigorous attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize competing deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive, autonomous, results-oriented, and excited to collaborate with cross-functional, international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 6 months minimum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris Headquarters (with hybrid flexibility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt; : 1200€&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt; High potential for conversion into a permanent contract (CDI) based on mutual fit and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact is an equal opportunity employer. We recruit solely based on merit and business needs, fostering an inclusive environment free from discrimination of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pilotez les missions où se jouent les paris IA des grands groupes, et transformez-les en résultats mesurables&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;L’IA, et en particulier l’IA agentique, figure parmi les priorités des comités de direction. Chez Artefact, nous sommes des makers. “We Make AI Work” : notre métier n’est pas de commenter l’IA, c’est de la faire fonctionner, à grande échelle, au cœur des grands groupes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Et tout commence par vous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu’&lt;strong&gt;AI Strategist Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, vous construisez avec les dirigeants de nos clients une stratégie IA crédible, un modèle opératoire adapté et un programme de transformation qui génère une valeur mesurable. Vous êtes le moteur de nos missions AI Strategy : vous les pilotez en autonomie, en garantissez la qualité, les délais et la rentabilité, faites grandir les consultants qui y sont staffés et développez vos comptes aux côtés des Directeurs et Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous commencez là où débute toute transformation IA : par l’ambition du client, son secteur d’activité et ses processus métier, et non par la technologie. Et vous restez un maker : vous ne vous arrêtez pas au slide. Vous construisez vous-même analyses, business cases et démos fonctionnelles (vibe coding, low-code, no-code) que le client peut toucher, et vous développez un domaine d’expertise solide dans un secteur ou une fonction métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous travaillez main dans la main avec nos équipes Engineering (qui construisent et livrent des solutions d’IA agentique) et nos équipes AI Adoption (qui favorisent leur adoption) : vous définissez les processus cibles et la roadmap, Engineering les construit et les livre, et AI Adoption accompagne les personnes dans le changement, dès le premier jour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activités &amp;amp; Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I. Conception de la stratégie et de la transformation IA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous définissez la vision IA et la roadmap priorisée des cas d’usage, challengez la pertinence de l’IA et assumez les arbitrages. Lorsque c’est pertinent, vous conduisez des refontes de processus de bout en bout, en pensant lean avant de déployer l’IA et en mobilisant les équipes Engineering et AI Adoption pour les livrer. Vous concevez le modèle opératoire cible et sécurisez ses conditions de succès.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;II. Analyses, business cases &amp;amp; prototypage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous concevez et pilotez les travaux d’analyse de la mission, business cases inclus, afin de sécuriser des décisions fondées sur les données et sur les faits, et vous revoyez le travail de l’équipe. Vous prototypez rapidement des cas d’usage pour illustrer la valeur par la démo et aider les clients à se projeter dans la solution finale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;III. Delivery, livrables &amp;amp; collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous dirigez les missions au quotidien en donnant de la visibilité aux sponsors clients : vous découpez chaque mission en streams, anticipez les risques et challengez le client lorsque c’est pertinent. Vous produisez en autonomie des livrables de niveau C-suite et des synthèses exécutives, structurez la storyline et veillez au respect des standards de qualité Artefact. Vous orchestrez les équipes Engineering pour la faisabilité technique et les équipes AI Adoption pour ancrer l’adoption sur le terrain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IV. Relation client &amp;amp; développement commercial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes l’interlocuteur de confiance des directeurs métiers et des responsables de projets (Comex-1) : vous cartographiez les rapports de force entre les parties prenantes, animez les restitutions pour emporter l’adhésion et maximiser le NPS client, et gérez les tensions et escalades en préservant la confiance. Vous détectez de nouveaux besoins sur le terrain, construisez le plan de développement du compte avec le Directeur ou le Partner et déclenchez de manière proactive des propositions pour développer les comptes existants, en contribuant aux propositions commerciales et aux soutenances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;V. Équipe &amp;amp; connaissances&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous encadrez et faites grandir les consultants juniors et seniors, êtes counsellor de plusieurs collègues et participez au recrutement des futurs talents. Vous contribuez aussi à la base de connaissances interne par des articles et des retours d’expérience, et animez des formations internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous vous reconnaissez si&lt;/strong&gt;… vous aimez piloter des missions exigeantes de bout en bout, faire grandir une équipe et gagner la confiance de dirigeants, et si vous préférez mettre une démo entre leurs mains plutôt que leur décrire une vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 à 8 ans d’expérience au sein d’un cabinet de conseil en stratégie, en management ou en transformation data / IA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une formation supérieure de niveau licence ou master, issue d’un cursus académique d’excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de pilotage de missions complexes, de la vision aux résultats, avec des business cases qui résistent à l’examen d’un Comex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une solide compréhension des enjeux opérationnels de l’IA (IA générative et agentique, gouvernance, cas d’usage métiers), avec la capacité de l’expliquer simplement à des dirigeants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de pilotage de projets de refonte de processus métier, avec une maîtrise avérée de certains processus métier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience du développement commercial (propositions, développement de comptes, relation avec des décideurs de haut niveau).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience d’encadrement d’une équipe de consultants, avec le goût de faire grandir, de déléguer et de tirer l’équipe vers le haut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un état d’esprit de maker : aisance avec les outils technologiques actuels et capacité à prototyper rapidement des démos fonctionnelles (low-code, no-code, outils agentiques) qui rendent la valeur tangible pour le client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise parfaite du français et de l’anglais (oral et écrit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos d’Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. À la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre accompagnement couvre l’intégralité de la chaîne de valeur : &lt;strong&gt;AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; (cadrage stratégique, opportunités à fort impact, trajectoires, modèles opératoires), &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; (industrialisation, architectures agentiques, produits data) et &lt;strong&gt;AI Adoption&lt;/strong&gt; (conduite du changement, montée en compétences, usage quotidien de l’IA).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour en savoir plus sur Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De la stratégie à la réalisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Ne pas s’arrêter aux recommandations : participer à la conception et à la concrétisation de solutions IA répondant à de véritables enjeux métiers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une collaboration entre expertises&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Occuper un rôle à la croisée de la stratégie (AI Strategy), de la technologie (Engineering) et de l&#39;humain (AI Adoption).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter ce qui compte&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Des missions de transformation IA de bout en bout, au cœur des enjeux des grands groupes, avec une vraie autonomie, une équipe à faire grandir et des comptes à développer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une trajectoire qui accélère &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Un parcours clair vers Senior Manager puis Directeur, dans un environnement d’apprentissage continu axé sur la transmission des connaissances et le pragmatisme technologique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit RH&lt;/strong&gt; (45&#39;) avec HR / Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;business case AI-driven&lt;/strong&gt; (60&#39;) avec un AI Strategist Senior Manager ou Directeur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;business case de prototypage IA hands-on&lt;/strong&gt; (60&#39;) avec un AI Strategist Senior Manager ou Directeur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;jeu de rôle AI Strategist Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (45&#39;-60&#39;) avec un AI Strategist Directeur ou Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit final&lt;/strong&gt; (30&#39;) avec un AI Strategist Partner ou Managing Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : 66 000€ à 75 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + 10 000€ de variable, selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l’adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated Marketing France connects global marketing strategy with local business priorities to deliver impactful marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As Senior Marketing Manager, Integrated Marketing, you will identify France’s priority marketing moments and translate global direction into a clear, integrated marketing plan. Using business performance, consumer insights and knowledge of the French market, you will recommend what to prioritise, what to adopt from global campaigns and what to adapt to maximise local impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will bring teams together around clear priorities, challenge recommendations constructively, simplify complex topics and ensure marketing initiatives deliver against France’s business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse business performance, consumer insights and market trends to recommend France’s priority marketing moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global marketing direction into an integrated France marketing plan, identifying what to adopt, adapt or challenge based on local business needs and market specificities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear, evidence-based recommendations on priorities and trade-offs, balancing expected impact, investment and available resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong rationale for local adaptations and influence global stakeholders when the French market requires a different approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Campaign Orchestration &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead campaign kick-offs and align local and global stakeholders around clear objectives, responsibilities and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge functional recommendations constructively, asking the right questions to ensure proposed media plans, creative concepts and campaign choices meet France’s objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify complex, cross-functional topics, clarify dependencies and facilitate decisions to keep initiatives moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate delivery risks, resolve coordination challenges and ensure campaigns are delivered on time and to the agreed brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Marketing Plan Consolidation &amp;amp; Executive Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate the France marketing plan into a clear, executive-level overview of key priorities, campaign choices, local adaptations and expected business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write concise, insight-led strategic memos articulating the rationale behind France’s marketing recommendations, key trade-offs and decisions requiring alignment or approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a compelling, evidence-based narrative connecting France’s business priorities and market specificities with global marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and defend France’s marketing recommendations to global executives, ensuring local choices are understood and enabling informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in integrated marketing, marketing strategy, campaign planning or marketing programme management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, analytical thinking and the ability to translate data and consumer insights into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong critical thinking and sound judgement: able to challenge assumptions, ask the right questions and assess whether proposed marketing choices support business objectives, without needing to be the technical expert in every discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance global consistency with relevant local adaptation, using clear evidence and constructive influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to simplify complex topics and align teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills, pragmatism and ownership, with a focus on prioritisation and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English, with the confidence to challenge and influence stakeholders in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, business-led recommendation of France’s priority marketing moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant local adaptations of global campaigns, supported by clear rationale and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alignment across stakeholders on priorities, decisions and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaigns delivered on time and against agreed objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, actionable performance insights and executive visibility on the France marketing plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lorsque l&#39;on vous dit Deliveroo, vous imaginez sans doute d&#39;abord les bons petits plats livrés chez vous en moins d&#39;une demi-heure. Plutôt sympa non ? Mais c&#39;est en coulisses que l&#39;histoire est la plus intéressante. Nous opérons désormais à travers le monde et travaillons avec plus de 176 000 restaurants partenaires et commerces en tous genres en France. Nous collaborons avec des milliers de livreurs et de livreuses partenaires pour le plus grand bonheur de nos millions de personnes clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un·e Assistant·e Chef de Projet Marketing Merchant en alternance pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing à Paris, pour une durée de 12 mois. Aux côtés de l&#39;équipe Merchant, vous contribuerez au développement de la croissance de nos partenaires, au déploiement de nos campagnes nationales 360° et en accompagnerez des projets à fort impact sur l&#39;acquisition, la rétention et la fidélisation de nos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Descriptif du poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu’Apprenti(e) dans l’équipe Marketing Merchant Restaurant, vous travaillerez au quotidien avec l&#39;équipe marketing chargée de mettre en avant toute la sélection de restaurants et de partenaires de Deliveroo. Vous serez également amené(e) à &lt;strong&gt;interagir régulièrement avec les autres départements marketing &lt;/strong&gt;tels que l’équipe média, l’équipe créative, le CRM ainsi qu’avec l’&lt;strong&gt;équipe commerciale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions consisteront à:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en avant sur l’application les restaurants et partenaires disponibles sur l’app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soutenir l’équipe commerciale dans la création et l’exécution de plans marketing destinés à mettre en avant les partenaires présents sur Deliveroo.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec l&#39;équipe commerciale et les équipes marketing transversales (marque, réseaux sociaux, CRM et influenceurs) pour développer et exécuter des plans partenaires basés sur les priorités commerciales (par exemple, objectifs régionaux, accords d&#39;exclusivité, renégociations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer des présentations et des supports pour appuyer les discussions de l&#39;équipe commerciale avec les partenaires, en veillant à l&#39;alignement et à la clarté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l’exécution des points forts des partenaires en collaboration avec le CRM et le Commercial (communications mensuelles d&#39;exclusivité / bannières dédiées sur l’application / notifications push...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer le budget alloué pour le plan de chaque partenaire, en optimisant les ressources locales pour obtenir un impact maximal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser l’impact de nos campagnes pour en tirer des recommandations pour les équipes commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette alternance vous permettra d&#39;appréhender de nombreux sujets marketing (création de campagne, analyse, sensibilité client) et vous permettra d&#39;acquérir une bonne connaissance des enjeux marketing et de la gestion de projets complexes grâce à la collaboration transverse que vous aurez avec les autres pôles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qui vous permettra de réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme de niveau Bac+4 ou Bac+5 en école de commerce, université ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en marketing, communication ou digital et recherchez une alternance d&#39;une durée d&#39;un an à partir de Décembre 2026 / Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous Vous Reconnaissez Dans Les Points Suivants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes organisé·e, rigoureux·se et savez gérer plusieurs projets en parallèle en respectant les délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une excellente communication écrite et orale en français ainsi qu&#39;un bon niveau d&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à l&#39;aise avec les chiffres et aimez analyser les performances pour en tirer des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous appréciez le travail en équipe et la coordination de nombreux interlocuteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux·se, proactif·ve et souhaitez évoluer dans un environnement dynamique et en forte croissance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voici un&lt;a href=&quot;https://sites.google.com/deliveroo.co.uk/biz-interview-guide/home?authuser=0&quot;&gt; lien&lt;/a&gt; avec de la documentation pour vous préparer aux entretiens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons un environnement de travail dynamique et stimulant, où vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de développer vos compétences et de contribuer activement à notre mission. Rejoignez notre équipe exceptionnelle dès maintenant et faites partie de cette aventure passionnante !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join a high-performing team laser-focused on taking over the market, building a world-class company, and solving the complex international expansion needs of thousands of employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this full-cycle outbound role, you will lead the charge in driving new logo acquisition across the EMEA region. We are looking for relentless hunters who excel at multi-threaded deal execution, master modern prospecting frameworks, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to maximize their impact. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a deep desire to win, this is your opportunity to build a high-growth sales career at the recognized leader in Employer of Record (EoR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeted Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute a sophisticated multi-channel prospecting motion (phone, email, social selling, video, etc.) to build a robust, high-quality pipeline across target EMEA accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Threaded Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strategic relationships across prospect organizations—from key operational champions up to economic buyers and C-level executives—aligning our solutions with their top-level business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the G-P Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a domain expert on global hiring, articulating the strategic, financial, and operational benefits of G-P as the premier global Employer of Record (EoR) provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex sales cycles from initial cold outreach to discovery, solution mapping, commercial proposal generation, objection handling, and deal closure against monthly targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorously Manage Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous pipeline hygiene across all prospect stages, ensuring accurate forecasting and high-quality data management within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal teams—including Sales Engineering, Legal, Marketing, Operations and Customer Success—to align resources, navigate complex deal requirements, and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Maximum Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Intentionally integrate modern generative AI and sales tech tools into your daily workflow to research accounts, personalize outreach, automate workflows, and increase sales velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, International Relations, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of sales experience, with 3+ years of proven success in a full-cycle, outbound-focused B2B sales role with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding revenue quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outbound Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of an end-to-end multi-channel prospecting motion, with advanced skills in cold outreach and C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; High competency and structured application of modern sales methodologies (e.g., Command of the Message, MEDDPICC, Challenger, Sandler, SPIN).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack &amp;amp; AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency with Salesforce and LinkedIn Sales Navigator. Hands-on experience leveraging modern Generative AI tools to enhance prospecting efficiency and workflow productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of B2B SaaS sales cycles, commercial negotiation, and complex buyer dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written, verbal, and presentation skills, with the ability to command attention, articulate complex value, and build immediate trust over video and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Mindset &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong desire to win, high coachability, a relentless growth mindset, and an authentic curiosity for solving complex customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience selling within the HR Tech, Employer of Record (EoR), global payroll, or workforce management ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Intelligence Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern revenue intelligence and tech stack tools (e.g., Gong, Clari, Cognism, Outreach).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1761669766.039629&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1761669766.039629&quot;&gt;
