&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
