&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;rc0wgi&quot; data-start=&quot;528&quot; data-end=&quot;548&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;548&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong data-start=&quot;554&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot;&gt;Global Alliance Director&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;Cato Networks&lt;/strong&gt; supports a focused portfolio of strategic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot;&gt;Global Systems Integrators (GSIs)&lt;/strong&gt;. This role contributes to alliance strategy, partner engagement, and revenue growth by working closely with senior alliance leadership and regional sales teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;The Global Alliance Manager plays a key role in executing joint go-to-market initiatives, driving co-sell activities, and building strong working relationships across partner organizations. Success in this role requires the ability to navigate complex partner environments, coordinate cross-functional teams, and translate alliance plans into measurable pipeline and bookings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;19a7fst&quot; data-start=&quot;1212&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1215&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;Target Alliance Accounts (Examples)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1256&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1256&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;Global Systems Integrators (GSIs):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;153ayic&quot; data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;Accenture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a97f52&quot; data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Deloitte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qv4esb&quot; data-start=&quot;1323&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;Capgemini&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;(Portfolio will be aligned to Cato’s strategic priorities and managed in collaboration with alliance leadership.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1458&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1pzghrs&quot; data-start=&quot;1460&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1463&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1yweu1s&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1493&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Alliance Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1886&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18p3e06&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;Support the day-to-day management of assigned GSI relationships in partnership with senior alliance leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r2h0ea&quot; data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development and execution of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;annual alliance plans&lt;/strong&gt;, including key initiatives, solution focus areas, and regional priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;64bv9q&quot; data-start=&quot;1798&quot; data-end=&quot;1886&quot;&gt;Help position Cato as a strategic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;SASE platform partner&lt;/strong&gt; within assigned alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1888&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;8zbz8f&quot; data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Revenue &amp;amp; Co-Sell Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2288&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p24i2a&quot; data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1938&quot; data-end=&quot;1989&quot;&gt;partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; in collaboration with regional sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ysovar&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2139&quot;&gt;Work with account teams to embed alliance partners into key opportunities and customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vn59v6&quot; data-start=&quot;2140&quot; data-end=&quot;2223&quot;&gt;Support the execution of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;repeatable co-sell motions&lt;/strong&gt; across target segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qdnpkj&quot; data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2288&quot;&gt;Track and report on alliance performance against defined KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2290&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;11mrzor&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2333&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2333&quot;&gt;Joint Solutions &amp;amp; Go-to-Market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2335&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cyguis&quot; data-start=&quot;2335&quot; data-end=&quot;2437&quot;&gt;Assist in identifying and developing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2374&quot; data-end=&quot;2420&quot;&gt;joint SASE and secure networking offerings&lt;/strong&gt; with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n3fxcq&quot; data-start=&quot;2438&quot; data-end=&quot;2542&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product, Marketing, and Technical Alliances teams to align messaging and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k7a5hm&quot; data-start=&quot;2543&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;Support joint marketing campaigns, demand generation programs, and partner-led events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2633&quot; data-end=&quot;2636&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1uqbfz1&quot; data-start=&quot;2638&quot; data-end=&quot;2677&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2642&quot; data-end=&quot;2677&quot;&gt;Partner Engagement &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2679&quot; data-end=&quot;2948&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uedl1u&quot; data-start=&quot;2679&quot; data-end=&quot;2784&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong working relationships with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2734&quot; data-end=&quot;2781&quot;&gt;partner stakeholders (Director to VP level)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n93fxw&quot; data-start=&quot;2785&quot; data-end=&quot;2861&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2795&quot; data-end=&quot;2844&quot;&gt;QBRs, pipeline reviews, and planning sessions&lt;/strong&gt; with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7psdkw&quot; data-start=&quot;2862&quot; data-end=&quot;2948&quot;&gt;Coordinate with internal and partner stakeholders to ensure alignment and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2950&quot; data-end=&quot;2953&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1iuh4el&quot; data-start=&quot;2955&quot; data-end=&quot;2993&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2959&quot; data-end=&quot;2993&quot;&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Partner Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vuadly&quot; data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3095&quot;&gt;Help drive partner enablement on Cato’s &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3037&quot; data-end=&quot;3092&quot;&gt;SASE architecture, differentiation, and positioning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;896f4a&quot; data-start=&quot;3096&quot; data-end=&quot;3189&quot;&gt;Support certification and readiness initiatives across partner sales and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1snl8h2&quot; data-start=&quot;3190&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;Identify and help remove execution blockers to accelerate pipeline growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3268&quot; data-end=&quot;3271&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1mpu2rs&quot; data-start=&quot;3273&quot; data-end=&quot;3303&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3277&quot; data-end=&quot;3303&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3305&quot; data-end=&quot;3525&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jjppuq&quot; data-start=&quot;3305&quot; data-end=&quot;3365&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3325&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;pipeline tracking and CRM hygiene&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1obbyat&quot; data-start=&quot;3366&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;Support reporting, dashboards, and performance tracking for assigned alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e3p3ae&quot; data-start=&quot;3450&quot; data-end=&quot;3525&quot;&gt;Assist in managing partner investments and tracking ROI where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3527&quot; data-end=&quot;3530&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;lrovnr&quot; data-start=&quot;3532&quot; data-end=&quot;3553&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3535&quot; data-end=&quot;3553&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;vqxc9b&quot; data-start=&quot;3555&quot; data-end=&quot;3571&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3559&quot; data-end=&quot;3571&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3573&quot; data-end=&quot;4018&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zi8j9i&quot; data-start=&quot;3573&quot; data-end=&quot;3671&quot;&gt;7–10 years of experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3603&quot; data-end=&quot;3668&quot;&gt;alliances, partner management, or enterprise technology sales&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4jsbpq&quot; data-start=&quot;3672&quot; data-end=&quot;3759&quot;&gt;Experience working with or supporting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3712&quot; data-end=&quot;3756&quot;&gt;GSI and/or service provider partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vbsbcz&quot; data-start=&quot;3760&quot; data-end=&quot;3839&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3785&quot; data-end=&quot;3836&quot;&gt;SASE, SD-WAN, networking, or security solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j77op2&quot; data-start=&quot;3840&quot; data-end=&quot;3923&quot;&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3878&quot; data-end=&quot;3920&quot;&gt;matrixed, cross-functional environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vv4ord&quot; data-start=&quot;3924&quot; data-end=&quot;4018&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with experience engaging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3979&quot; data-end=&quot;4017&quot;&gt;Director- to VP-level stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4020&quot; data-end=&quot;4023&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;9cv1wj&quot; data-start=&quot;4025&quot; data-end=&quot;4042&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4029&quot; data-end=&quot;4042&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4044&quot; data-end=&quot;4308&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fjwety&quot; data-start=&quot;4044&quot; data-end=&quot;4174&quot;&gt;Experience working with partners such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4087&quot; data-end=&quot;4171&quot;&gt;Accenture, Deloitte, Capgemini, BT, Orange, NTT, Comcast, or Tata Communications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r12jvz&quot; data-start=&quot;4175&quot; data-end=&quot;4244&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4189&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;cloud-delivered networking or security platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k9yhjh&quot; data-start=&quot;4245&quot; data-end=&quot;4308&quot;&gt;Experience in high-growth or scaling technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick is on an exciting journey to harness the power of artificial intelligence and data science to enhance the way we work and the advice we provide to clients. As we continue to expand our AI capabilities, we are looking for an AI Engineer to join our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining AI-powered applications that deliver real value across the business. Working closely with our existing AI team, you will help build innovative solutions using modern AI technologies, with a particular focus on large language models (LLMs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for someone with hands-on experience developing and deploying AI applications who enjoys solving complex problems, working with a high degree of autonomy, and turning emerging technologies into practical, high-quality products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will thrive in this role if you are curious, creative, and passionate about applying AI to solve real-world business challenges. You take pride in writing robust, maintainable code and enjoy collaborating with colleagues to continuously improve and expand our AI capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support, run, and iterate existing AI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, deploy, and maintain new AI applications which can be scaled across multiple business use cases, driving operational and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trial and test solutions with end users to iterate and optimise them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and analyse data sets using a variety of statistical and machine learning techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and understand the evolving AI landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be a highly professional, well-rounded individual with strong problem-solving skills, engineering expertise, strategic thinking, and excellent interpersonal skills. They will have a strong academic background complemented by an outstanding career to date. Standout candidates will demonstrate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building solutions with large language models (LLMs) and a deep understanding of the broader generative AI landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing datasets, conducting model evaluations, and fine-tuning foundation models to improve task-specific performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python development skills, including experience writing production-quality code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with front-end technologies such as JavaScript, React, HTML, and CSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of statistics and machine learning fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree in a quantitative discipline, such as Mathematics or Computer Science, or equivalent relevant industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to communicate technical concepts effectively to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to thrive in a fast-paced, evolving environment with changing priorities and an iterative, user-focused approach to development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, a strong sense of ownership, and the ability to work effectively both independently and collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in professional services would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing cloud applications on Microsoft Azure would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps practices and tools (e.g. CI/CD, Git) would be desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of, or experience with, secure software development practices would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are joining a client facing team, a core services team, or starting out on your professional career journey, joining Brunswick unlocks a range of employee benefits to support your financial future, health and wellness, family and community and continuous professional development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About Brunswick&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick is a global advisory firm. We help companies tackle high-stakes issues, navigate complex stakeholder relationships, and deliver high-impact outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our clients value our ability to anticipate, shape, and respond to the key players and forces in the financial and investment arena, regulatory and geopolitical universe, NGO community, workforce and beyond. They rely on us for deep experience, fresh perspectives and original thinking. So, in Brunswick you will find an exceptional range of experience and talent with a rich mix of backgrounds. From the beginning, we have prioritized attracting, developing, and retaining the best professionals in the industry, united by a culture of inclusivity, excellence, and intellectual curiosity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1987 in London, the firm has organically grown to 27 offices in 18 countries across the Americas, Europe, Middle East, Africa, Asia and Australia. We operate as a “one-firm firm” with no individual profit centers. This allows us to assemble fully integrated, bespoke teams for each client, able to draw on the full resources of Brunswick anywhere in the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Brunswick is an equal opportunity employer. &amp;nbsp;All qualified applicants will be considered without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, disability, pregnancy, genetic information, or any other status protected by applicable law. Please&amp;nbsp;read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brunswickgroup.com/app/uploads/Group-Privacy-Notice-for-Employees_April-2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to understand how your data is managed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Datadog’s in-house product experts, the Technical Escalation Engineering (TEE) team plays a critical role in driving our global success. We enable our customers, from the world’s most innovative startups to the largest enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through deep technical expertise, relentless problem-solving, and exceptional customer engagement, we educate, guide, and troubleshoot, delivering high-impact solutions that shape the customer experience. Whether through hands-on technical call, in-depth fact findings meeting, or complex investigations, we set the gold standard for technical excellence and customer advocacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our TEE team, you’ll tackle the most challenging technical problems, collaborate directly with Engineering and Product to refine and evolve our platform, and mentor teams worldwide, elevating the technical bar at every level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Technical Escalation Engineering (TEE) team, you’ll operate at the heart of Datadog’s ecosystem, working at the intersection of Technical Solutions, Engineering, Product, and our Customers. Every challenge you take on will directly impact the performance, scalability, and success of both our clients and our platform. You’ll be in an environment that moves fast, challenges you daily, and rewards curiosity, ownership, and technical excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your chance to shape the future of observability and security, driving innovation, mentoring teams, and influencing product direction while witnessing your expertise make an immediate and lasting impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the global expert on Alerting &amp;amp; Monitoring within the Technical Solutions team, supporting TSEs and customers in building reliable, actionable monitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own investigations into alert-related escalations, identifying root causes across metric behavior, configuration edge cases, and backend evaluation logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering to flag inconsistent monitor behavior, propose enhancements, and ensure alignment with user expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable diagnostics, reusable response strategies, and field-ready resources to shorten time to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enablement efforts, from async training to live office hours, ensuring that Solutions teams worldwide understand Datadog’s alerting system.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in debugging alert misfires, delayed or missing notifications, noisy monitors, and complex alerting logic involving scopes, groups, and recovery thresholds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable interpreting how data aggregation, gaps, or late points affect alert evaluation and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident navigating APIs, tagging strategies, downtime configurations, and best practices for scalable alerting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about helping customers reduce alert fatigue while increasing visibility into meaningful signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Datadog’s alerting system, from monitor types (metric, composite, anomaly, logs, SLO, etc.) to thresholds, evaluation windows, and notification rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Software Engineering Interns to help build and scale the systems that power Datadog’s observability and security platform. Interns contribute directly to real-world engineering challenges across backend, frontend, infrastructure, data engineering, and developer tooling while working alongside experienced engineers and mentors. You’ll help design, build, and improve systems that process and analyze massive volumes of metrics, logs, and application data in real time. Whether you’re interested in distributed systems, Kubernetes, AI-powered products like Bits AI, or developer platform tooling, you’ll work on meaningful projects that deliver impact for customers at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to production systems that process and analyze large-scale observability and application data in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve distributed systems across backend infrastructure, developer platforms, and cloud-native services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify and solve performance, reliability, and scalability challenges in critical services supporting Datadog’s growing customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver technical projects from design through deployment with guidance from experienced engineers and mentors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop technical expertise through hands-on experience with technologies such as Kubernetes, distributed systems, and cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with fellow interns, mentors, and engineers while building software that delivers impact at global scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field, or have equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Targeting a 2027 full-time start date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong computer science fundamentals, including data structures, algorithms, and software design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable coding in one or more programming languages and excited to use AI-assisted tools to enhance software development and problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience using AI coding tools or a strong interest in learning how to use them effectively while exploring how AI can improve engineering practices and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available to complete a 6-month internship beginning in February, March, April, May, or June 2027 (we are unable to accommodate internships starting at any other time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We know not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That’s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your experience, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on meaningful technical challenges alongside engineers across the globe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in mentorship and buddy programs designed to support learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join an in-person intern cohort, attend company social events, and engage with Datadog Community Guilds and employee resource groups throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive relocation support and travel benefits where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy office perks including snacks, drinks, and catered lunches on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please ensure that you submit your CV/resume in English. If possible, please apply using your personal email address instead of your university email address.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Students can sign up for a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/datadog-github-student-developer-pack/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;free Datadog Pro account&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our platform and products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
