&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;The Compliance Specialist, EMEA is a subject matter expert who owns employment, labor, and statutory compliance across the region (primarily France, Spain, Portugal, Netherlands, Ireland and UK). This is an individual-contributor role where you will be the region&#39;s go-to authority on People compliance, partnering closely with People Operations, Legal, People Business Partners and regional stakeholders to build and maintain compliant people processes that enable Datadog&#39;s continued growth in EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join a growing team - currently a Compliance Coordinator and an incoming Apprentice joining in September - and will work closely with them, bringing a more experienced, hands-on perspective to help scale the team&#39;s compliance capabilities across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on, operational role suited to someone who enjoys working in the details, partnering cross-functionally, and building a strong foundation of People compliance across multiple countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture, the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Own ongoing compliance with employment laws and regulations across EMEA, including tracking regulatory updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Own compliance oversight for employment contracts, health and safety in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Manage accommodation requests end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Partner with People Operations and Legal to resolve compliance questions and mitigate risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Own compliance with statutory medical requirements in EMEA (requirements differ by country)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Own statutory compliance obligations related to hiring employees with disabilities, including reporting duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Lead work rule updates, Works Council coordination (France and Netherlands), and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Own mandatory training compliance tracking and timely submission of required government reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Design, maintain, and evolve People policies and procedures to reflect current employment law across the region, including leave entitlements, termination and redundancy rules, working hours, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a regional compliance calendar and audit cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Lead or support internal and external audits, and manage responses to regulator inquiries and government requests for information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Contribute to building scalable compliance processes within People Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with counterparts in the Americas and APAC regions to share best practices and harmonize policies and processes where practicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in People Operations, HR compliance, or employment administration in an EMEA regional role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;AI-savvy, with a genuine interest in identifying where AI tools can streamline compliance processes and drive efficiency gains. Comfortable applying AI to repetitive or high-volume compliance work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented and comfortable working with complex, multi-jurisdiction regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;Organized and reliable, with the ability to manage recurring compliance tasks and deadlines without close oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;A self-starter with solid business acumen and sound judgment; able to distinguish material compliance risk from lower-priority administrative gaps and communicate that distinction clearly to stakeholders at every level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;A collaborative partner who communicates clearly with cross-functional stakeholders across People Operations, Legal, Payroll, Benefits, PBPs, Security and Office Ops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;Experienced with building or running compliance calendars, risk registers, or internal/external audit programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you&#39;re passionate about People Operations and compliance and want to grow your experience in a global environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous and competitive benefits package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous career development and pathing opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product training to develop an in-depth understanding of our product and space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best in breed onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal mentor and buddy program cross-departmentally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friendly and inclusive workplace culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c03ffd59c47&quot;&gt;Datadog&#39;s client SDKs run inside our customers&#39; mobile apps and websites, and every Datadog client-side product depends on them, including Real User Monitoring, Session Replay, Product Analytics, and Feature Flags. We maintain 11 open source SDKs across Browser, iOS, Android, React Native, Flutter, Kotlin Multiplatform, Unity, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;556&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f8d86b9cd1f&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d4b51c5266b7&quot;&gt;As the Engineering Manager for Client SDKs, you&#39;ll build and lead the team that makes it easy for any team at Datadog to ship into those SDKs safely: fast CI, predictable releases, a shared spec across SDKs, and tooling that lets engineers and coding agents contribute without waiting on a review queue. It&#39;s a rare chance to own a developer platform that ships in public, at a scale where small decisions reach a lot of customers, and to shape how Datadog builds client-side products in the AI-native era. Both the team and its scope are expanding, so there&#39;s plenty of room to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6a69a6751f3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1146&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7aef1bb028d2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1395&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2018ed9e7108&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1397&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19ac52ea1d4c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;141c414110d1&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c0fdb6d9afd1&quot;&gt;Build, lead, and grow a team of mostly senior software engineers, hiring well and helping senior and staff engineers grow their impact and careers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1566&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4a242ca8649a&quot;&gt;Own CI and test infrastructure across the SDK repositories: set health targets, detect and quarantine flaky tests, and provide test frameworks that engineers and coding agents can run locally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1761&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7485705fd393&quot;&gt;Define release cadences and help customers adopt updates, managing breaking changes in SDKs that can&#39;t be rolled back once they&#39;re installed in customers&#39; apps&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1924&quot; data-local-id=&quot;910ec1935dd3&quot;&gt;Keep SDKs consistent through a shared specification, and remove the review bottleneck so product teams can ship SDK changes without waiting on a small group of experts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2095&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a941ea74f856&quot;&gt;Partner with product teams such as Session Replay, Product Analytics, and Feature Flags, along with our SDK guilds and server SDK teams, to guide SDK changes from design to release&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fde46df16714&quot;&gt;Build feature sets for new product capabilities and bring that to all partner teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2366&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2c15a2e5b523&quot;&gt;Bring AI coding agents into how the team builds, tests, and ships, and take part in business-hours release, hotfix, and support escalation duty (no 24/7 pager)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a154eb3d9162&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2531&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7336f270387&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd5f1f663f52&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d18e4c59eab6&quot;&gt;Experienced in managing a team of software engineers, including senior engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2631&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91c82112ab4d&quot;&gt;Someone who has shipped and maintained SDKs, libraries, or developer tools that other engineers depend on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2740&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0f502495afba&quot;&gt;Strong in at least one of Mobile Platforms, including iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin) , or Browser (TypeScript), and able to hold a technical conversation about applications development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2928&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0bacffec9a99&quot;&gt;Knowledgeable in release engineering, CI/CD, versioning, and backwards compatibility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3016&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94160173fd68&quot;&gt;Able to influence other teams without formal authority and build alignment across product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3115&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f587adedd83c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3117&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c98fe3fc2480&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bef6e5397bc7&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3134&quot; data-local-id=&quot;25713b294804&quot;&gt;Open source maintainer experience, especially working with outside contributors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3217&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ef825088643d&quot;&gt;Experience with observability, crash reporting, analytics, or OpenTelemetry SDKs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c9b9946205e4&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cross-platform frameworks such as React Native, Flutter, or Kotlin Multiplatform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3402&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ce33da2914cf&quot;&gt;Experience leading a platform or developer experience team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3464&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd27dcb74eb7&quot;&gt;Experience using AI coding agents in your team&#39;s workflow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d106fa4dc176&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3527&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e27094c5e265&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you&#39;re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3760&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98c851609893&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3762&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74f111f0c8b0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b13c1d91020d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3786&quot; data-local-id=&quot;25cbf3d64113&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3858&quot; data-local-id=&quot;542e5be0e979&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;63c0f0599d45&quot;&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4005&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca2d33d5b4c8&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4110&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa41c9647038&quot;&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our internal panel discussions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4171&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7eb8187d4a2c&quot;&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4246&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cdde6437677e&quot;&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;96a4fec5882c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa89bb81a3a4&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute Verifone’s marketing strategy in France and play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth in one of Europe’s most dynamic payments markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Marketing Manager, you’ll be the engine behind France’s marketing performance: building the systems, dashboards, and processes that power smarter decisions, stronger campaigns, and measurable commercial impact. You’ll lead both day‑to‑day execution and long‑term strategy, ensuring our brand, messaging, and demand generation efforts land with precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full marketing funnel - from awareness and acquisition to retention and installed‑base growth and you’ll bring hands‑on expertise in marketing automation, lead nurturing, and multi‑channel campaign orchestration. Email, digital, content, events… you know how to blend them into high‑performing programs that generate qualified leads and fuel sales momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries clear accountability: hitting France’s lead targets, elevating lead quality and conversion, enriching data, automating processes, and delivering sharp reporting across programs and channels. Your work will directly influence pipeline, performance, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, manage and implement marketing programs and strategies for Verifone France and Paybox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and update the Verifone Regional websites (Including Paybox): website maintenance, supervising the creation and development of websites, including creating specification documents to improve the website and other online projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the advertising campaigns and the relationship with the agency, including creating lists of keywords that define campaigns, creating and testing ads/banners specific for targeted verticals, set-up and monitor end to end lead tracking (sources/channels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess about results: analyze site traffic and website flows, conversion optimization campaign results, analyze and report program performance; report metrics appropriately and flag issues for internal stakeholders, provide recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose new marketing strategies and implement new ideas that can improve overall funnel performance, from brand awareness to client retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage email nurture flows and/or drip programs for both prospects and existing customers to support sales growth and retention, and implement the tracking of these flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple teams for developing an effective strategy and new programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French speaker with advanced English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, or a related field, with strong foundations in modern digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading integrated, multi‑channel marketing campaigns across digital, content, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on mastery of key platforms, including &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=Explain_marketing_automation_tools&quot;&gt;marketing automation tools&lt;/span&gt; (Pardot, Marketo, etc.), &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=What_is_a_CRM_and_how_is_it_used&quot;&gt;CRMs&lt;/span&gt; such as Salesforce or Pipedrive, Google Analytics, social platforms (Facebook, Instagram), and email marketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical capability to manage complex lead lifecycles, optimize funnel performance, and extract insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills to coordinate cross‑functional initiatives and deliver high‑impact marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up‑to‑date knowledge of industry trends, emerging technologies, and modern marketing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEM‑focused copywriting skills to craft compelling, conversion‑driven search content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML for landing page and email optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert‑level Excel skills, including large dataset handling and macro‑based automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in suggesting new concepts/ideas, self-motivated, fast learner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented and problem-solving attitude (use analytical and creative thinking to find solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, great attention to detail, openness to testing and analyzing large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: ability to cooperate and work fairly with others, at all levels, within and outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work under tight deadlines when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tool uptime and ensure excellent execution of installation and support of hardware issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain, and ensure the relevance of technical information used by internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and build long-term innovative global technology systems that enable enhanced customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure communication vehicles, e.g. telephone, email, and presentation, etc. are able to facilitate efficient and consistent customer follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the customer experience through team, hardware, software, and support tool development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and manage new product installs and subsequent hardware development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects manage new evaluations and ensure the success of the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional assigned tasks when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business travel is required when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in building collaborative partnerships with customers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with tight deadlines and multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English language fluency is required as you will be working with international clients and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;VML&lt;/strong&gt;, nous croyons que les grandes idées naissent quand les talents peuvent être pleinement eux-mêmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Née en 2024 de la fusion de &lt;strong&gt;Wunderman Thompson&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;VMLY&amp;amp;R&lt;/strong&gt;, deux agences parmi les plus créatives et primées au monde, VML est aujourd’hui une agence internationale de référence, au croisement de la &lt;strong&gt;créativité&lt;/strong&gt;, de la &lt;strong&gt;technologie&lt;/strong&gt; et de la &lt;strong&gt;data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsée dans le TOP 5 des agences créatives aux Cannes Lions 2025, et réitérant cette performance en se classant dans le TOP 4 aux derniers Cannes Lions 2026, VML a aussi été récompensée dans toutes les compétitions majeures cette année. Leader reconnu sur l’IA, et en forte croissance sur toutes nos expertises, nous sommes auréolés depuis le 1er janvier 2026 du titre d’&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l&#39;Année&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre force ? Une approche intégrée qui réunit &lt;strong&gt;Brand Experience (BX)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience (CX)&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Commerce (CO)&lt;/strong&gt; pour concevoir des expériences de marque uniques, impactantes et durables - pour les consommateurs comme pour les marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML a également lancé &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; en 2025 (&lt;em&gt;désormais &lt;strong&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;), une entité spécialisée dans la transformation des entreprises centrée sur le client. Cette initiative stratégique qui a fait suite à l&#39;intégration réussie de Velvet Consulting, cabinet de conseil reconnu. &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; incarne la dimension conseil du groupe et fédère, à l’échelle internationale, l’ensemble des &lt;strong&gt;expertises technologiques et data&lt;/strong&gt; de VML.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avec &lt;strong&gt;plus de 30 000 talents dans le monde&lt;/strong&gt;, dont plus de &lt;strong&gt;500 en France répartis entre Paris &amp;amp; Toulouse&lt;/strong&gt;, VML est avant tout une communauté de profils passionnés : créatifs, stratèges, designers, développeurs, experts data, social media, influence, gaming, IA, CRM, e-commerce… Des expertises diverses, une même envie : &lt;strong&gt;imaginer ce qui fait avancer les marques et les usages&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez VML, c’est :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-évoluer dans un environnement &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;collaboratif et pluridisciplinaire&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-apprendre en continu sur des projets ambitieux et internationaux,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-contribuer à des campagnes reconnues et primées (&lt;strong&gt;Cannes Lions, Effie Awards, Grand Prix Stratégies…&lt;/strong&gt;),&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;et faire partie d’une agence élue&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l’Année&lt;/strong&gt; en 2022, 2023 et 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre culture&lt;/strong&gt; repose sur la passion, l’audace créative, l’ouverture et une obsession de l’innovation — avec la conviction que la performance durable commence toujours par les talents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envie de grandir, d’apprendre et de créer avec nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoignez l’aventure VML !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons notre futur(e) &lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Planning Stratégique Social&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;au sein d&#39;une équipe dédié à un client international prestigieux. Au carrefour de la data, de la culture digitale et de la stratégie de marque, tu décrypteras ce que disent les communautés pour transformer les conversations en insights actionnables, en recommandations percutantes et en briefs créatifs inspirants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Démarrage&lt;/strong&gt; : Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Social Listening, Veille &amp;amp; Intelligence Culturelle&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitorer et analyser les conversations en ligne via nos outils de social listening sur nos marques, nos concurrents et nos industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décrypter les tendances émergentes (TikTok, Reels, formats vidéo, mèmes, communautés de niche) et identifier les opportunités de &lt;em&gt;newsjacking&lt;/em&gt; ou de prise de parole rapide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des rapports de veille et d’écoute synthétiques et visuels qui donnent du sens à la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Planning Stratégique &amp;amp; Recommandations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l’élaboration des recommandations stratégiques (idées, activations, calendriers éditoriaux).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des briefs d’action social media : angles d’attaque, tone of voice, formats prioritaires, KPIs attendus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nourrir les équipes en insights culturels et comportementaux frais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Suivi de Production (Touche-à-tout)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à la déclinaison et au suivi de production des assets de contenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre la main à la pâte : tester des formats, prototyper des idées et soutenir l’équipe opérationnelle au besoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Lab IA &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser et tester activement les outils d’IA générative pour accélérer la recherche, l’analyse et l’idéation créative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Bac+4/5 (École de communication, commerce, IEP, CELSA ou Master spécialisé) à la recherche d’un stage de césure ou de fin d&#39;études.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Internet &amp;amp; Social Native :&lt;/strong&gt; Une passion réelle pour l&#39;écosystème digital et les usages de communautés (TikTok, Instagram, X, Reddit, Discord).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d’analyse &amp;amp; d’insight :&lt;/strong&gt; Aptitude à transformer de la data brute et du bruit conversationnel en angles stratégiques exploitables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aisance rédactionnelle &amp;amp; Storytelling :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu as une belle plume, l’esprit de synthèse et le sens du design de présentations (Google Slides, PowerPoint, Keynote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agilité IA :&lt;/strong&gt; Curieux(se) et déjà utilisateur(trice) d&#39;outils d’IA générative au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement international&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance professionnelle en anglais, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral, pour analyser des conversations mondiales, concevoir des présentations et échanger avec les équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager Social Commerce DACH will be responsible for growing and scaling SharkNinja’s TikTok Shop and new social commerce platforms for the DACH market. This role requires a mix of e-commerce expertise, social commerce insight, and hands-on execution. You will drive revenue growth through strategic campaign management, creator partnerships, and optimization of Social Commerce operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage P&amp;amp;L for TikTok Shop Germany and other social platforms, delivering against sales and profitability targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content &amp;amp; creator partnerships: Build and scale relationships with TikTok creators, agencies, and affiliates to drive product awareness and sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign execution: Develop, launch, and optimize TikTok campaigns, leveraging data-driven insights to maximize ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promotions &amp;amp; pricing: Strategically plan couponing, discounting, bundles, and seasonal activations to accelerate growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration: Work closely with Category Marketing, D2C e-Commerce, operations, and global TikTok teams to ensure smooth execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; reporting: Monitor KPIs (GMV, ROAS, CAC, retention) and deliver regular performance updates to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market insights: Stay on top of TikTok Shop trends, competitor strategies, and platform updates to keep SharkNinja ahead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in e-commerce, digital marketing, or social commerce; TikTok Shop/affiliate marketing experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of TikTok’s creator economy and affiliate ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with experience in data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent relationship-building and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills; able to thrive in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English (written &amp;amp; spoken).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sharkninja.com/dei&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/sharkninja/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life At SharkNinja&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLmRfBxyGu_mKl9SF12lM1NAIx-z07uLNQ&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Outrageously Extraordinary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:336}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;129&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;127&quot;&gt;SharkNinja Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;131&quot; data-end=&quot;402&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;131&quot; data-end=&quot;224&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;224&quot;&gt;For candidates based in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;172&quot;&gt;all regions&lt;/strong&gt;, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sharkninja.com/candidate-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot;&gt;For candidates based in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;260&quot;&gt;China&lt;/strong&gt;, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sharkninja.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice-china.html&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;313&quot; data-end=&quot;402&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;315&quot; data-end=&quot;402&quot;&gt;For candidates based in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;350&quot;&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sharkninja.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice-vietnam.html&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, or any other class protected by legislation, and local law. SharkNinja will consider reasonable accommodations consistent with legislation, and local law. If you require a reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, please contact SharkNinja People &amp;amp; Culture at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----------
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Partner Sales Manager to ignite partnerships by identifying and recruiting new partners for long-term success and nurture ongoing relationships with key strategic Global Systems Integrator partners. Our ultimate goal is building channels and alliances that drive new customer adoption and revenue. This is a great opportunity for you to join a high-growth cloud software company and help blaze the path for our company&#39;s expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and recruit new strategic Global SI partners to drive revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and activate existing GSI partners through training, planning and joint selling activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the technical and marketing aspects of integrated partnership launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host regular business reviews with partners to drive accountability and report on success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with Datadog’s regional enterprise and commercial sales organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate partner-sourced net-new sales pipeline and revenue&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of partner-facing, quota-carrying experience in business development, strategic alliances, or channel sales at a cloud services or software as a service organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in driving sales opportunities from lead generation to closure, effectively negotiating agreements and building long-lasting partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of, and exposure to working with, the leading Global and regional SIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand technical concepts and architectural scenarios, and explain them to others verbally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 40-50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a passion for taking initiatives from ideation to impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for fast-paced, sometimes unpredictable growth culture and environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in SaaS and / or consumption based software platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in identifying market opportunities with a track record of initiating go-to-market plans and sales follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a passion for taking initiatives from ideation to impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for fast-paced, sometimes unpredictable growth culture and environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in identifying market opportunities with a track record of initiating go-to-market plans and sales follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in SaaS and / or consumption based software platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with systems management or monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with partnerships supporting Containers and/or DevOps, particularly in a cloud environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background/education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Field Engineering organization at CoreWeave supports the customers running some of the largest AI workloads in the world. Technical Solutions Management owns the technical relationship with our strategic customers: we&#39;re the people their engineering leaders call first, and the people who get CoreWeave&#39;s delivery, operations, support and engineering teams moving for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Solutions Manager, you&#39;ll own the technical relationship with a small number of strategic customers who are defining how AI gets built. Their deployments run to thousands of GPUs, often on hardware that is new to the whole industry. You&#39;ll be the customer&#39;s technical advocate inside CoreWeave from contract through delivery, onboarding and day-to-day operations, and you&#39;ll drive the programs that get their capacity into production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring at Senior and Staff levels. Staff TSMs take our largest, multi-site accounts and lead programs across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical relationship with your customers&#39; engineering and executive leaders, and be the person they trust to tell them what&#39;s really happening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run delivery and onboarding programs end to end, from contract and site readiness to the day the customer runs production work on new capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read each account&#39;s health every week, catch problems early, and drive cross-team issues to an owner and a resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate Fleet Operations, Capacity, data center, support and engineering teams on your customers&#39; behalf, leading through influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry customer needs into Product and Engineering and follow them through to a decision, then close the loop with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account executives on one customer message, and with Specialist Field Engineers on technical depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team scale: improve our playbooks and tooling, interview, and mentor newer TSMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in technical program management, technical account management, solutions architecture, customer success engineering or professional services delivery with cloud infrastructure customers. For Staff, 8+ years and ownership of large, complex accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning the technical relationship with large customers, including their engineering and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving long-running, multi-team programs to a date and an outcome, with senior visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of cloud infrastructure: compute, networking, storage and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, both long form (plans, status reports, incident reviews) and short form (chat and email).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raises risk early, escalates with judgment, and stays calm under customer pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GPU clusters, HPC, or AI training and inference platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Slurm, InfiniBand or high-performance storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a hyperscaler, GPU cloud, or AI hardware or systems vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience bringing up new data center capacity or new hardware generations for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams, even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;d rather own the outcome than track the tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can explain a hard technical trade-off to an engineer and to an executive in the same afternoon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You give customers bad news early and honestly, with a plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like building the process while you&#39;re running it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Updated privacy notice - UK and EU Job Applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Field Engineering organization at CoreWeave supports the customers running some of the largest AI workloads in the world. Technical Solutions Management owns the technical relationship with our strategic customers: we&#39;re the people their engineering leaders call first, and the people who get CoreWeave&#39;s delivery, operations, support and engineering teams moving for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager of Technical Solutions Management, you&#39;ll build and lead the TSM team for a region: US East from our Livingston office, or EMEA from London, which also covers our customers in Asia-Pacific. Your team owns the technical relationship with some of CoreWeave&#39;s most strategic customers, and you&#39;ll make sure every one of them has a strong technical owner from contract onward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll hire and grow the team, run the operating rhythm that keeps every account healthy, step into the most critical escalations, and hold executive relationships with the region&#39;s largest customers. You report to the Director of Technical Solutions Management and work closely with sales, Specialist Field Engineering, operations, support and engineering leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the regional TSM team: hiring, onboarding, coaching, career growth and performance, across senior, staff and early-career TSMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure every strategic customer in your region has the right technical owner, and balance books as accounts grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the operating rhythm: weekly account health reviews, risk and escalation handling, and clear reporting to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the most critical escalations, and build executive relationships with the region&#39;s largest customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales and Specialist Field Engineering leaders on account strategy, and with Fleet Operations, Capacity, support and engineering on delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how TSMs work: playbooks, tooling and metrics that let the team scale while keeping quality high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry customer needs and trends from your region into Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in customer-facing technical roles such as technical account management, technical solutions management, solutions architecture, customer success engineering, support or delivery leadership, with cloud or infrastructure customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years leading teams, including hiring, developing and managing the performance of senior individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning executive relationships with large, technically sophisticated customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of cloud infrastructure: compute, networking, storage and Kubernetes. Enough depth to be credible with customer engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building the processes, metrics and operating rhythm that let a team scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, including presenting complex technical situations to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 30%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GPU, HPC or AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams across multiple countries or time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a hyperscaler, GPU cloud, or AI hardware or systems vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams, even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You measure yourself by how well your team does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You give customers and leadership bad news early, with a plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can tell the interesting problem from the urgent one, and help your team see the difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like building the playbook while you&#39;re&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
